(3913186, 555167, 47316, '<td valign="top">Eee! lol. Nice dof. It''s hard to see this as a portrait though, perhaps I''m just in the "mammal box" or "macro box" on this one as far as it being a portrait is concerned. I like the composition and the choice of b/w.</td>', 'Eee! lol. Nice dof. It''s hard to see this as a portrait though, perhaps I''m just in the "mammal box" or "macro box" on this one as far as it being a portrait is concerned. I like the composition and the choice of b/w.', '2007-07-18 05:37:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3913188, 556922, 47316, '<td valign="top">Very cute expression! Shame it''s a bit dark on the face, perhaps you could have selectively brightened him a bit so as not to blow out the higlights too much in the back? Nice job on the eyes!</td>', 'Very cute expression! Shame it''s a bit dark on the face, perhaps you could have selectively brightened him a bit so as not to blow out the higlights too much in the back? Nice job on the eyes!', '2007-07-18 05:38:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3913190, 554875, 47316, '<td valign="top">hmmm... interesting profile. Seems a little too disconnected to me but perhaps that was the aim. The tones and contrast are great.</td>', 'hmmm... interesting profile. Seems a little too disconnected to me but perhaps that was the aim. The tones and contrast are great.', '2007-07-18 05:40:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3913192, 557062, 81471, '<td valign="top">not sure about the outfit?</td>', 'not sure about the outfit?', '2007-07-18 05:41:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3913194, 556389, 47316, '<td valign="top">Interesting... like the Lady of Shallot or Ophelia kind of thing. This is really cool! I always wanted to do a shoot like this! I like the processing, like an old photo, adds to the whole theme. The only thing that might have added to this is perhaps some greenery like vines or lily pads or flowers. Might have done a little more to hide the bottom of the swimming pool too and give it more of a pond or lake feel.</td>', 'Interesting... like the Lady of Shallot or Ophelia kind of thing. This is really cool! I always wanted to do a shoot like this! I like the processing, like an old photo, adds to the whole theme. The only thing that might have added to this is perhaps some greenery like vines or lily pads or flowers. Might have done a little more to hide the bottom of the swimming pool too and give it more of a pond or lake feel.', '2007-07-18 05:42:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3913195, 555875, 81471, '<td valign="top">interesting light</td>', 'interesting light', '2007-07-18 05:43:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3913201, 556797, 47316, '<td valign="top">Oh boy. These kind of shots really do nothing for me. It seems just there for the sake of attention as opposed to saying something about the model. So trying to put aside my bias, some places that could have been inproved... lighting. It seems brightest on her stomach and even blown out on her arm. I''d like to see more light and attention on her face. The pose is really unnatural. There are better ways to do implied nudity, like perhaps laying on her stomach. The lipstick print seems completely unnecessary unless this is some sort of commentary on lesbianism, in which case the person who put it there should be in the photo as well. If it''s a tattoo... well then I would have cloned it out.</td>', 'Oh boy. These kind of shots really do nothing for me. It seems just there for the sake of attention as opposed to saying something about the model. So trying to put aside my bias, some places that could have been inproved... lighting. It seems brightest on her stomach and even blown out on her arm. I''d like to see more light and attention on her face. The pose is really unnatural. There are better ways to do implied nudity, like perhaps laying on her stomach. The lipstick print seems completely unnecessary unless this is some sort of commentary on lesbianism, in which case the person who put it there should be in the photo as well. If it''s a tattoo... well then I would have cloned it out.', '2007-07-18 05:47:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3913203, 553664, 47316, '<td valign="top">cute, simple expression. I''d usually like to see a little more with children because they have such a wide range of expressions. Depth of field is nice.</td>', 'cute, simple expression. I''d usually like to see a little more with children because they have such a wide range of expressions. Depth of field is nice.', '2007-07-18 05:48:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3913205, 555901, 47316, '<td valign="top">cute natural candid photo. The crop along with her hunched position seems a bit odd. Might like to see this type of shot without her looking, just drawing and doing her thing.</td>', 'cute natural candid photo. The crop along with her hunched position seems a bit odd. Might like to see this type of shot without her looking, just drawing and doing her thing.', '2007-07-18 05:49:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3913207, 556332, 47316, '<td valign="top">Wish the focus was actually on the bird vendor as opposed to the cages for the sake of this being a portrait challenge... actual just in general for that matter. The cages aren''t very engaging as the bars are too close together to really see much.</td>', 'Wish the focus was actually on the bird vendor as opposed to the cages for the sake of this being a portrait challenge... actual just in general for that matter. The cages aren''t very engaging as the bars are too close together to really see much.', '2007-07-18 05:51:08.000000', NULL, 1),
