(3913263, 556354, 47316, '<td valign="top">I want to see her dance! This is a pretty portrait and you have certainly captures some of her personality but as an environmental portrait (or at least that''s what I think it to be with the setting and the title) I''d like to see her dancing, or at least interacting more with her surroundings.</td>', 'I want to see her dance! This is a pretty portrait and you have certainly captures some of her personality but as an environmental portrait (or at least that''s what I think it to be with the setting and the title) I''d like to see her dancing, or at least interacting more with her surroundings.', '2007-07-18 06:37:39.000000', NULL, 1),
