(3913267, 555034, 79403, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  However, I think the picture can be a little warmer.</td>', 'Nice composition.  However, I think the picture can be a little warmer.', '2007-07-18 06:41:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3913268, 555056, 47316, '<td valign="top">This one made me kinda chuckle. I think because he looks a bit like Seinfeld. This is a fun candid and the shadow adds a little... something to it. Makes me think of a fun childlike spirit (Peter Pan maybe?) Only now looking more I think I see a face and I''m confused and realize it''s a spectator... oh well, it was fun as a shadow, lol. Perhaps my monitor is too dark...</td>', 'This one made me kinda chuckle. I think because he looks a bit like Seinfeld. This is a fun candid and the shadow adds a little... something to it. Makes me think of a fun childlike spirit (Peter Pan maybe?) Only now looking more I think I see a face and I''m confused and realize it''s a spectator... oh well, it was fun as a shadow, lol. Perhaps my monitor is too dark...', '2007-07-18 06:41:16.000000', NULL, 1),
