(3913272, 555777, 47316, '<td valign="top">Pretty soft light on this. I might have cropped in a little tighter or further. Where the arm is hanging now is just such a shame, I hate cut limbs. Would love to see her more active, like be able to see the flowers she is throwing (if she is).</td>', 'Pretty soft light on this. I might have cropped in a little tighter or further. Where the arm is hanging now is just such a shame, I hate cut limbs. Would love to see her more active, like be able to see the flowers she is throwing (if she is).', '2007-07-18 06:42:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3913273, 556981, 47316, '<td valign="top">His face seems a bit overprocessed to me, the eyes look way too bright to be natural. I like the serious expression and the choice of bw, though it could use a bit more contrast.</td>', 'His face seems a bit overprocessed to me, the eyes look way too bright to be natural. I like the serious expression and the choice of bw, though it could use a bit more contrast.', '2007-07-18 06:43:27.000000', NULL, 1),
