(3913276, 555320, 47316, '<td valign="top">I don''t get the in her own world from this. When I first looked at the photos before the title it just looked to me like a girl that was caught at a bad time like blinking or about to sneeze. The lighting is really harsh.</td>', 'I don''t get the in her own world from this. When I first looked at the photos before the title it just looked to me like a girl that was caught at a bad time like blinking or about to sneeze. The lighting is really harsh.', '2007-07-18 06:44:22.000000', NULL, 1),
