(3913283, 556836, 47316, '<td valign="top">lol... well I wouldn''t have fought you on that (though I prefer to see humans). The processing and colors are nice on this. Cool kind of profile. Wish I could see the eye a bit better, from what I can see it seems a to be a cool color!</td>', 'lol... well I wouldn''t have fought you on that (though I prefer to see humans). The processing and colors are nice on this. Cool kind of profile. Wish I could see the eye a bit better, from what I can see it seems a to be a cool color!', '2007-07-18 06:47:58.000000', NULL, 1),
