(3913295, 556563, 47316, '<td valign="top">This would be a nice portrait without the other set of eyes. What is the purpose and what is is suppose to say about her? For me it says nothing. Perhaps if the eyes were done better and there was a bit of context... like for example... She is a girl that got made fun of for having glasses, so perhaps she is looking at her glasses and thinking of her herself as this "four eyed girl", possibly have an out of focus group of peers in the back as the "bullies". <br/> <br/>The dof is nice, the skin tones could use some tweaking.</td>', 'This would be a nice portrait without the other set of eyes. What is the purpose and what is is suppose to say about her? For me it says nothing. Perhaps if the eyes were done better and there was a bit of context... like for example... She is a girl that got made fun of for having glasses, so perhaps she is looking at her glasses and thinking of her herself as this "four eyed girl", possibly have an out of focus group of peers in the back as the "bullies".  The dof is nice, the skin tones could use some tweaking.', '2007-07-18 06:55:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3913296, 555829, 79403, '<td valign="top">The picture is a little out of focus and the colors could use some more editing (if you have already edited the colors).  Otherwise good composition.</td>', 'The picture is a little out of focus and the colors could use some more editing (if you have already edited the colors).  Otherwise good composition.', '2007-07-18 06:55:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3913298, 556283, 47316, '<td valign="top">Very cute! Love the natural expression. Angle is a bit too much for me though, I keep tilting my head. I like it,  just perhaps a little less. It gives a fun carefree feel.</td>', 'Very cute! Love the natural expression. Angle is a bit too much for me though, I keep tilting my head. I like it,  just perhaps a little less. It gives a fun carefree feel.', '2007-07-18 06:56:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3913299, 553071, 47316, '<td valign="top">You cannot take a portrait of a garage. Put a person in there and it would be an interesting shot. The shadows are great though I think it could use a bit more post processing to make it less washed out looking around the sky.</td>', 'You cannot take a portrait of a garage. Put a person in there and it would be an interesting shot. The shadows are great though I think it could use a bit more post processing to make it less washed out looking around the sky.', '2007-07-18 06:57:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3913300, 556982, 47316, '<td valign="top">Great candid! Love the crisp line of light around him! The tones and contrast are great. Only improvement I guess would be that I''d like to see more of his face.</td>', 'Great candid! Love the crisp line of light around him! The tones and contrast are great. Only improvement I guess would be that I''d like to see more of his face.', '2007-07-18 06:58:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3913301, 556731, 47316, '<td valign="top">Cute expression, very natural portrait. THe colors could use a bit of tweaking and the sky coould use a little work to make the image pop a little more.</td>', 'Cute expression, very natural portrait. THe colors could use a bit of tweaking and the sky coould use a little work to make the image pop a little more.', '2007-07-18 06:59:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3913304, 553512, 79403, '<td valign="top">The picture is a little too over-exposed for my taste and also I think that a different t-shirt could improve on the picture, rather than just a plain polo.  The background is too distracting for me and I''m almost irritated that half of the flower is cut out of the picture (I''d rather it be all in or all out).  I give it a 5.</td>', 'The picture is a little too over-exposed for my taste and also I think that a different t-shirt could improve on the picture, rather than just a plain polo.  The background is too distracting for me and I''m almost irritated that half of the flower is cut out of the picture (I''d rather it be all in or all out).  I give it a 5.', '2007-07-18 06:59:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3913305, 556271, 77543, '<td valign="top">Nice simple shot. The light colour at the bottom of the background is a slight distraction that should have been removed.</td>', 'Nice simple shot. The light colour at the bottom of the background is a slight distraction that should have been removed.', '2007-07-18 06:59:58.000000', NULL, 1),
