(3913308, 556827, 47316, '<td valign="top">I like this and I can''t put my finger on why. These guys just seem mischevious or fun (neither word is right for what I''m looking for, oh well), esp the one leaning with the toothpick. I keep trying to figure out the context and what is hanging behind them. I guess that''s what I like about it, I''m wondering the story.</td>', 'I like this and I can''t put my finger on why. These guys just seem mischevious or fun (neither word is right for what I''m looking for, oh well), esp the one leaning with the toothpick. I keep trying to figure out the context and what is hanging behind them. I guess that''s what I like about it, I''m wondering the story.', '2007-07-18 07:02:37.000000', NULL, 1),
