(3913316, 554928, 79403, '<td valign="top">The picture needs to be better composed.  The main focus should be focused on the cat, but it''s the blanket in the background that draws my attention.  I also think that cat needs to be doing something a little more interestingso that people would want to look at the picture rather than glancing at it.  For me it''s a 3...sorry!</td>', 'The picture needs to be better composed.  The main focus should be focused on the cat, but it''s the blanket in the background that draws my attention.  I also think that cat needs to be doing something a little more interestingso that people would want to look at the picture rather than glancing at it.  For me it''s a 3...sorry!', '2007-07-18 07:04:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3913317, 556750, 47316, '<td valign="top">Way to much processing on this. Very strange image. He seems upset or something and a bit too old for the drool thing to be cute. I don''t see how the title relates.</td>', 'Way to much processing on this. Very strange image. He seems upset or something and a bit too old for the drool thing to be cute. I don''t see how the title relates.', '2007-07-18 07:05:10.000000', NULL, 1),
