(3913322, 555359, 79403, '<td valign="top">I love the colors and the softness of this picture.  The only thing that I noticed is that the model''s forehead is greenish, which makes her look like an alien from another planet.  You get an 8.</td>', 'I love the colors and the softness of this picture.  The only thing that I noticed is that the model''s forehead is greenish, which makes her look like an alien from another planet.  You get an 8.', '2007-07-18 07:07:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3913323, 556980, 47316, '<td valign="top">Lovely image, conveys emotion nicely. Though I wish it was a little brighter on the face. Not sure if this was a shoot or a candid, but if I had my way I think I''d have his face in the light where the hand is and have his back and the and in the shadows so as to make the hand secondary to the child. As it is now the hand is very overpowering in the image.</td>', 'Lovely image, conveys emotion nicely. Though I wish it was a little brighter on the face. Not sure if this was a shoot or a candid, but if I had my way I think I''d have his face in the light where the hand is and have his back and the and in the shadows so as to make the hand secondary to the child. As it is now the hand is very overpowering in the image.', '2007-07-18 07:07:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3913324, 553192, 77543, '<td valign="top">I like the lines in the plants matching the direction of the dog. I''d have cropped it to position the dog further to the left.</td>', 'I like the lines in the plants matching the direction of the dog. I''d have cropped it to position the dog further to the left.', '2007-07-18 07:07:38.000000', NULL, 1),
