(3913705, 556074, 36382, '<td valign="top">I like the closeness of the crop and his eye contact.  It makes the picture feel very intimate.  The only nitpick is the pipe? next to his ear on the left of the picture.   I wish you could have cloned that out.  The window on the other side doesn''t bother me at all, in fact I think it adds to the picture.  Overall, I like this quite a bit. 8.</td>', 'I like the closeness of the crop and his eye contact.  It makes the picture feel very intimate.  The only nitpick is the pipe? next to his ear on the left of the picture.   I wish you could have cloned that out.  The window on the other side doesn''t bother me at all, in fact I think it adds to the picture.  Overall, I like this quite a bit. 8.', '2007-07-18 09:50:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3913706, 556218, 49109, '<td valign="top">not much of a portrait. blown highlights, stong sharpening halos.</td>', 'not much of a portrait. blown highlights, stong sharpening halos.', '2007-07-18 09:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
