(3914246, 555698, 64929, '<td valign="top">Avast!  Arrrr! There''s something scarey about this shot!!<br/>But it''s the kind of scarey that makes you keep wanting to look at it...again and again!  A little over the top in processing, IMHO, but what a cool perspective!  *7*</td>', 'Avast!  Arrrr! There''s something scarey about this shot!!But it''s the kind of scarey that makes you keep wanting to look at it...again and again!  A little over the top in processing, IMHO, but what a cool perspective!  *7*', '2007-07-18 12:20:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3914255, 556730, 73564, '<td valign="top">Like the title to this one, she would have been better posed in a jazzier background, with the make up and nails (mainly the nails), I picture a more natural person posed with a natural background, I also would have cloned out the white spot on the left,and the one by her cheek, a tad distracting. She can deffinatley pose, a great image otherwise, 7.</td>', 'Like the title to this one, she would have been better posed in a jazzier background, with the make up and nails (mainly the nails), I picture a more natural person posed with a natural background, I also would have cloned out the white spot on the left,and the one by her cheek, a tad distracting. She can deffinatley pose, a great image otherwise, 7.', '2007-07-18 12:25:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3914259, 556901, 48268, '<td valign="top">Your focus is soft and the pixels on the left side of her face are blown.</td>', 'Your focus is soft and the pixels on the left side of her face are blown.', '2007-07-18 12:27:03.000000', NULL, 1),
