(3914367, 553299, 56828, '<td valign="top">Here eyes lookk weird.  The whites are too white I think.  I love the photo, but it''s weird at the same time.</td>', 'Here eyes lookk weird.  The whites are too white I think.  I love the photo, but it''s weird at the same time.', '2007-07-18 12:59:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3914372, 554121, 73564, '<td valign="top">This is one great image, but when I looked up the meaning of portrait it said "of a person" just because alot of people are knit pickey here, I am not saying DNMC, this will probably score better than my image of a person, I really love the colors and all the detail to it. I will have to score this a 6 just because of the quality and great work. Please correct me if I am wrong in the meaning of portrait.</td>', 'This is one great image, but when I looked up the meaning of portrait it said "of a person" just because alot of people are knit pickey here, I am not saying DNMC, this will probably score better than my image of a person, I really love the colors and all the detail to it. I will have to score this a 6 just because of the quality and great work. Please correct me if I am wrong in the meaning of portrait.', '2007-07-18 13:01:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3914376, 556745, 73564, '<td valign="top">I am baffled at how you got this image (angle) looks to be under water, but dry. Is he in front of an aquarium? I really like the colors here, and the great pose, 7.</td>', 'I am baffled at how you got this image (angle) looks to be under water, but dry. Is he in front of an aquarium? I really like the colors here, and the great pose, 7.', '2007-07-18 13:03:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3914379, 556836, 28172, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting and nice expression and composition. 8</td>', 'Beautiful lighting and nice expression and composition. 8', '2007-07-18 13:03:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3914383, 555184, 73564, '<td valign="top">The focus point is a bit odd in the image, looks a liitle fuzzy on my monitor, the lighting is ok, 6.</td>', 'The focus point is a bit odd in the image, looks a liitle fuzzy on my monitor, the lighting is ok, 6.', '2007-07-18 13:04:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3914385, 553962, 73564, '<td valign="top">Nice image, I would have tried to avoid getting the car in the background, the colors and lighting are very nice, 6.</td>', 'Nice image, I would have tried to avoid getting the car in the background, the colors and lighting are very nice, 6.', '2007-07-18 13:05:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3914395, 553850, 64929, '<td valign="top">Great shot but somehow it feels like there''s a wee too much noise reduction/neat imaging on the face.  Nice capture, tho!</td>', 'Great shot but somehow it feels like there''s a wee too much noise reduction/neat imaging on the face.  Nice capture, tho!', '2007-07-18 13:08:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3914402, 556759, 64929, '<td valign="top">Seems wayyyy to orange in the tones, IMHO.  But great expression captured</td>', 'Seems wayyyy to orange in the tones, IMHO.  But great expression captured', '2007-07-18 13:09:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3914405, 556898, 64929, '<td valign="top">Very pretty and vintage-like.  Nice job *7*</td>', 'Very pretty and vintage-like.  Nice job *7*', '2007-07-18 13:10:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3914406, 556545, 73564, '<td valign="top">The colors are o.k., the pose is nice, I don''t see why some one would be wearing make-up in the jacuzzi, and I would have never guessed her in the jacuzzi if it weren''t for her wrist to be wet,I guess I am just trying to connect the title with the pic, but otherwise nice photo, 6.</td>', 'The colors are o.k., the pose is nice, I don''t see why some one would be wearing make-up in the jacuzzi, and I would have never guessed her in the jacuzzi if it weren''t for her wrist to be wet,I guess I am just trying to connect the title with the pic, but otherwise nice photo, 6.', '2007-07-18 13:10:48.000000', NULL, 1),
