(3914432, 554359, 44728, '<td valign="top">Hmm horizontal is leaning to the right and that piece of brick is sticking out of his shoulder.. it looks also a bit gray-ish. I think you could''ve got more out of this picture with a better composition and post processing.</td>', 'Hmm horizontal is leaning to the right and that piece of brick is sticking out of his shoulder.. it looks also a bit gray-ish. I think you could''ve got more out of this picture with a better composition and post processing.', '2007-07-18 13:18:07.000000', NULL, 1),
