(3914468, 556882, 39679, '<td valign="top">Very strong contrast.  To my mind it''s a bit distracting.  Maybe pulling a shade on the window would have softened it a bit or a reflector on the "dark" side of your subject''s face to even out the lighting a bit.</td>', 'Very strong contrast.  To my mind it''s a bit distracting.  Maybe pulling a shade on the window would have softened it a bit or a reflector on the "dark" side of your subject''s face to even out the lighting a bit.', '2007-07-18 13:27:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3914470, 555955, 57745, '<td valign="top">this amazing man! how did you create a shoot like manny librodo? do you mean that you are a genius too, like him?</td>', 'this amazing man! how did you create a shoot like manny librodo? do you mean that you are a genius too, like him?', '2007-07-18 13:28:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3914494, 555852, 6388, '<td valign="top">it all becomes clear to me now...I know this face - and the photography - though the color threw me for a second.  Beautifully processed as always, and the pretty face doesn''t hurt either.  If it were anyone else I''d wonder if the background/eye color matching was a coincidence, but in this case I''m 99% sure it was just good planning :)  Bellissimo.</td>', 'it all becomes clear to me now...I know this face - and the photography - though the color threw me for a second.  Beautifully processed as always, and the pretty face doesn''t hurt either.  If it were anyone else I''d wonder if the background/eye color matching was a coincidence, but in this case I''m 99% sure it was just good planning :)  Bellissimo.', '2007-07-18 13:37:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3914504, 556130, 33165, '<td valign="top">Amazing!</td>', 'Amazing!', '2007-07-18 13:41:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3914511, 556981, 64929, '<td valign="top">Very nice pose and choice of black and white. *7*</td>', 'Very nice pose and choice of black and white. *7*', '2007-07-18 13:44:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3914517, 556890, 39427, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and the tones very much, kudos to you for being brave enough for a side-view portrait.  My only complaint is that it seems a bit soft.</td>', 'I like the composition and the tones very much, kudos to you for being brave enough for a side-view portrait.  My only complaint is that it seems a bit soft.', '2007-07-18 13:45:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3914525, 556798, 67258, '<td valign="top">A well considered portrait.  I am currently unconvinced by the hand (I had at first glance taken it to be the models)- why is it there, what does it add?  I shall revsit later in the week and see if my perception changes.  The dark background combined with the border works very well. I particular like the way the light catches the necklace.</td>', 'A well considered portrait.  I am currently unconvinced by the hand (I had at first glance taken it to be the models)- why is it there, what does it add?  I shall revsit later in the week and see if my perception changes.  The dark background combined with the border works very well. I particular like the way the light catches the necklace.', '2007-07-18 13:48:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3914527, 554121, 77176, '<td valign="top">Wow!  terrific shot.   But is it a portrait?</td>', 'Wow!  terrific shot.   But is it a portrait?', '2007-07-18 13:48:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3914536, 555569, 48227, '<td valign="top">OMG, she is adorable!!!!!!!!!!!!!! Great portrait. 10</td>', 'OMG, she is adorable!!!!!!!!!!!!!! Great portrait. 10', '2007-07-18 13:49:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3914538, 556802, 67258, '<td valign="top">A candid portrait that works well.  The light is wonderful; it not only picks out the skin tones well, but also the rich mahogony colour of the violin.  The setting is bizarre, which adds to the photos ''story'' and appeal.  My only real gripe is with the pedestrian immediately behind the violinist. None the less, a strong photograph.</td>', 'A candid portrait that works well.  The light is wonderful; it not only picks out the skin tones well, but also the rich mahogony colour of the violin.  The setting is bizarre, which adds to the photos ''story'' and appeal.  My only real gripe is with the pedestrian immediately behind the violinist. None the less, a strong photograph.', '2007-07-18 13:50:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3914543, 556230, 39427, '<td valign="top">this lighting is fantastic, and the expression is just ... awesome.  My only complaints are that (1) I wish there was more in focus on her face and (2) I can''t tell what she''s gnawing on there.  These are minor tho - 8 :)</td>', 'this lighting is fantastic, and the expression is just ... awesome.  My only complaints are that (1) I wish there was more in focus on her face and (2) I can''t tell what she''s gnawing on there.  These are minor tho - 8 :)', '2007-07-18 13:50:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3914544, 554307, 48227, '<td valign="top">Fantastic portrait, great clarity and what a beautiful child!! 10</td>', 'Fantastic portrait, great clarity and what a beautiful child!! 10', '2007-07-18 13:50:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3914554, 556109, 68757, '<td valign="top">Great shot, nice composition and his expression matches the title of the photo.</td>', 'Great shot, nice composition and his expression matches the title of the photo.', '2007-07-18 13:54:06.000000', NULL, 1),
