(3914566, 553299, 39427, '<td valign="top">cool composition and great light, i just think this is a tad over-processed (even by my standards :P)  still a 7.</td>', 'cool composition and great light, i just think this is a tad over-processed (even by my standards :P)  still a 7.', '2007-07-18 13:57:32.000000', NULL, 1),
