(3915391, 556911, 73564, '<td valign="top">Nice picture and pose, could have named it "one of those days", great work, 6.</td>', 'Nice picture and pose, could have named it "one of those days", great work, 6.', '2007-07-18 17:03:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915392, 553067, 78356, '<td valign="top">The effect doesn''t work for me, just MHO.</td>', 'The effect doesn''t work for me, just MHO.', '2007-07-18 17:03:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915394, 554578, 57456, '<td valign="top">As if hes in his own spotlight.</td>', 'As if hes in his own spotlight.', '2007-07-18 17:03:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915395, 556441, 30049, '<td valign="top">Very cute.  B/W is fine, but it seems short at both ends (black and white).  Some minor adjustments via curves or levels, plus a minor boost in contrast, would help this substantially IMO.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Very cute.  B/W is fine, but it seems short at both ends (black and white).  Some minor adjustments via curves or levels, plus a minor boost in contrast, would help this substantially IMO.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-07-18 17:04:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915396, 556219, 78356, '<td valign="top">Nice done.</td>', 'Nice done.', '2007-07-18 17:04:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915397, 554087, 73564, '<td valign="top">Coming from a bird mother (he he) this one beautiful bird, the lighting is nice, and the colors are very vibrant, 6.</td>', 'Coming from a bird mother (he he) this one beautiful bird, the lighting is nice, and the colors are very vibrant, 6.', '2007-07-18 17:05:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915398, 556858, 57456, '<td valign="top">I like the red in her hair and the red in the bricks. They seem to tie in well together.</td>', 'I like the red in her hair and the red in the bricks. They seem to tie in well together.', '2007-07-18 17:05:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915400, 554578, 73564, '<td valign="top">I really like the colors in this image, that little thing is weird, but makes for a nice picture. 6.</td>', 'I really like the colors in this image, that little thing is weird, but makes for a nice picture. 6.', '2007-07-18 17:06:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915404, 553601, 73564, '<td valign="top">Very nice lighting, and the colors are great, 6.</td>', 'Very nice lighting, and the colors are great, 6.', '2007-07-18 17:07:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915405, 557054, 57456, '<td valign="top">Good use of light..Soft in the areas where it matters and crisp around the eyes. very nicely done.</td>', 'Good use of light..Soft in the areas where it matters and crisp around the eyes. very nicely done.', '2007-07-18 17:07:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915406, 556346, 47316, '<td valign="top">The lighting is really harsh here and this is really candid for a portrait. Candids aren''t always a bad thing but this is showing us very little about the model, we can''t even see his face well. I think for a candid to work in this type of challenge it has to be well done and show some emotion, a laugh or a smile or even him throwing a temper tantrum.</td>', 'The lighting is really harsh here and this is really candid for a portrait. Candids aren''t always a bad thing but this is showing us very little about the model, we can''t even see his face well. I think for a candid to work in this type of challenge it has to be well done and show some emotion, a laugh or a smile or even him throwing a temper tantrum.', '2007-07-18 17:08:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915410, 555964, 39679, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  The use of complimentary colors is almost always a good choice and the colors are nicely vivid without being over saturated.  However, I feel there is just a little too much empty space above your subject''s head.  The photo doesn''t feel balanced to me.</td>', 'Nice shot.  The use of complimentary colors is almost always a good choice and the colors are nicely vivid without being over saturated.  However, I feel there is just a little too much empty space above your subject''s head.  The photo doesn''t feel balanced to me.', '2007-07-18 17:08:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915412, 555382, 57456, '<td valign="top">Photo looks a little flat across the board to me. Could be the effect you were going for, I am not sure. Her eyes draw my attention to them very well.</td>', 'Photo looks a little flat across the board to me. Could be the effect you were going for, I am not sure. Her eyes draw my attention to them very well.', '2007-07-18 17:09:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915414, 555661, 47316, '<td valign="top">The light here makes her skin look quite nice. My issue with this image is it doesn''t show much, I think we need to be able to see more of her face and her thought process, esp with this downward angle in addition to her head turned, we lose all sight of her eyes.</td>', 'The light here makes her skin look quite nice. My issue with this image is it doesn''t show much, I think we need to be able to see more of her face and her thought process, esp with this downward angle in addition to her head turned, we lose all sight of her eyes.', '2007-07-18 17:10:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915416, 553786, 57456, '<td valign="top">WOW! I really like this photo alot. Detail is very nice even down to the eyes. Great Job!</td>', 'WOW! I really like this photo alot. Detail is very nice even down to the eyes. Great Job!', '2007-07-18 17:10:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915417, 554629, 73564, '<td valign="top">Great image, nice lighting, 7.</td>', 'Great image, nice lighting, 7.', '2007-07-18 17:11:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915420, 557072, 57456, '<td valign="top">Very pretty child with clear eyes and beautiful skin. Good job with the crispness around her eyes.</td>', 'Very pretty child with clear eyes and beautiful skin. Good job with the crispness around her eyes.', '2007-07-18 17:11:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915422, 556982, 39679, '<td valign="top">Nice use of light!  The outline of the skater is wonderful.  However, there is an awful lot of black in the image which, to me, makes the image seem "heavy".</td>', 'Nice use of light!  The outline of the skater is wonderful.  However, there is an awful lot of black in the image which, to me, makes the image seem "heavy".', '2007-07-18 17:11:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915423, 556953, 47316, '<td valign="top">For him to be just sitting there I think you should have brought it in a lot closer, the scenery doesn''t add much to the image. If you wanted to leave it all in perhaps have him in a more active pose (running around, playing, etc) and include more mountains, less grass as the grass isn''t very interesting at all.</td>', 'For him to be just sitting there I think you should have brought it in a lot closer, the scenery doesn''t add much to the image. If you wanted to leave it all in perhaps have him in a more active pose (running around, playing, etc) and include more mountains, less grass as the grass isn''t very interesting at all.', '2007-07-18 17:12:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915429, 556890, 60657, '<td valign="top">Very natural side profile. Good composition and crop.</td>', 'Very natural side profile. Good composition and crop.', '2007-07-18 17:13:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915432, 554942, 73564, '<td valign="top">Nice image, very close up, the lighting is great, 6.</td>', 'Nice image, very close up, the lighting is great, 6.', '2007-07-18 17:13:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915436, 554041, 47316, '<td valign="top">Cute, natural capture, shows a real close connection between the subjects. The editing is nice and simple. Some room for improvement might have been to get a little more light on the faces and have her sit up a bit straighter as her head looks kind of cocked up uncomfortably.</td>', 'Cute, natural capture, shows a real close connection between the subjects. The editing is nice and simple. Some room for improvement might have been to get a little more light on the faces and have her sit up a bit straighter as her head looks kind of cocked up uncomfortably.', '2007-07-18 17:14:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915439, 556960, 73564, '<td valign="top">Nice image, I was waiting for some images with hats or interesting wardrobe, the colors are good the lighting is great, 7.</td>', 'Nice image, I was waiting for some images with hats or interesting wardrobe, the colors are good the lighting is great, 7.', '2007-07-18 17:15:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915440, 556771, 57456, '<td valign="top">Not sure if it was intentional, but I like the light slightly above the eyes.</td>', 'Not sure if it was intentional, but I like the light slightly above the eyes.', '2007-07-18 17:15:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915441, 556905, 60657, '<td valign="top">Has a certain amount of Mona-Lisa''ish intrigue... is she curious? focussed? Beautiful eyes indeed. Nice crop.</td>', 'Has a certain amount of Mona-Lisa''ish intrigue... is she curious? focussed? Beautiful eyes indeed. Nice crop.', '2007-07-18 17:15:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915443, 556847, 47316, '<td valign="top">Cute expression. The crop is a bit odd and the lighting is pretty harsh.</td>', 'Cute expression. The crop is a bit odd and the lighting is pretty harsh.', '2007-07-18 17:15:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915446, 555569, 39679, '<td valign="top">I normally hate shots of kids as too many people rely on their inherent "cuteness" rather than exploring them as an interesting subject.  You''ve done an excellent job of using a child as a model.  <br/> <br/>Her eyes are all the more compelling because of your choice to shoot the rest of the shot as nearly monochrome and while there''s no denying the "child''s innocence" and sense of wonder, you could almost substitute an adult and get nearly as good a shot. Great work.</td>', 'I normally hate shots of kids as too many people rely on their inherent "cuteness" rather than exploring them as an interesting subject.  You''ve done an excellent job of using a child as a model.   Her eyes are all the more compelling because of your choice to shoot the rest of the shot as nearly monochrome and while there''s no denying the "child''s innocence" and sense of wonder, you could almost substitute an adult and get nearly as good a shot. Great work.', '2007-07-18 17:16:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915448, 556799, 73564, '<td valign="top">Very nice clean composition, I like this image, the lighting is great, 7.</td>', 'Very nice clean composition, I like this image, the lighting is great, 7.', '2007-07-18 17:16:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915452, 553980, 73564, '<td valign="top">Great image, there is alot of depth, the lighting is nice, 7.</td>', 'Great image, there is alot of depth, the lighting is nice, 7.', '2007-07-18 17:17:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915454, 557028, 39679, '<td valign="top">Yes...yet ANOTHER picture of a child. ;)  The shot isn''t bad but the border is a bit distracting.</td>', 'Yes...yet ANOTHER picture of a child. ;)  The shot isn''t bad but the border is a bit distracting.', '2007-07-18 17:17:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915457, 556947, 57456, '<td valign="top">When it is all said and done, I would really like to know how you post-processed this photo. Her skin seems so soft and she has amaizing eyes. I like the light and shadow usage as well.</td>', 'When it is all said and done, I would really like to know how you post-processed this photo. Her skin seems so soft and she has amaizing eyes. I like the light and shadow usage as well.', '2007-07-18 17:18:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915460, 556532, 73564, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, I love the suspenders, the colors are really good, 8.</td>', 'Nice picture, I love the suspenders, the colors are really good, 8.', '2007-07-18 17:18:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915461, 554587, 47316, '<td valign="top">I like this. It is simple and there is a good conection with the viewer through his eyes. His outfit and his necklace are different and coupled with the setting make me think there is a story behind this which is always a good thing. Some room for improvement: His hat could have been pushed up a bit, I hate in photos when things are really close to people''s eyes. Also he seems a bit dark.</td>', 'I like this. It is simple and there is a good conection with the viewer through his eyes. His outfit and his necklace are different and coupled with the setting make me think there is a story behind this which is always a good thing. Some room for improvement: His hat could have been pushed up a bit, I hate in photos when things are really close to people''s eyes. Also he seems a bit dark.', '2007-07-18 17:18:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915470, 556074, 57456, '<td valign="top">Crisp and clean photo. I am able to cound individual hairs on his head, and brows, and ears, and nose....Not making fun of your photo, I really do like it. You did very well on this.</td>', 'Crisp and clean photo. I am able to cound individual hairs on his head, and brows, and ears, and nose....Not making fun of your photo, I really do like it. You did very well on this.', '2007-07-18 17:19:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915473, 555875, 47316, '<td valign="top">Pretty, natural image with some nice soft colors. I love the sky  and the ocean. I don''t really like the kind of blury soft thing you did with this, at least not for her. Maybe you could have kept it for the background and faded it out for her face.</td>', 'Pretty, natural image with some nice soft colors. I love the sky  and the ocean. I don''t really like the kind of blury soft thing you did with this, at least not for her. Maybe you could have kept it for the background and faded it out for her face.', '2007-07-18 17:20:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915475, 555593, 73564, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, colors are good, the image looks a tad bit fuzzy on my monitor, and you could have cropped a little to avoid distractions in the background, other than that the image is very nice, 6.</td>', 'Nice picture, colors are good, the image looks a tad bit fuzzy on my monitor, and you could have cropped a little to avoid distractions in the background, other than that the image is very nice, 6.', '2007-07-18 17:20:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915476, 554629, 39679, '<td valign="top">I like this shot.  Having your subject wear brown (roughly the same color as the horse) really makes for a sense of unity between the two.  <br/> <br/>I would really like to see more of the model''s face though.  The image seems unbalanced because I can see the horses face but not the girl''s.  How strange does THAT sound?</td>', 'I like this shot.  Having your subject wear brown (roughly the same color as the horse) really makes for a sense of unity between the two.   I would really like to see more of the model''s face though.  The image seems unbalanced because I can see the horses face but not the girl''s.  How strange does THAT sound?', '2007-07-18 17:20:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915478, 556838, 47316, '<td valign="top">cute scenario but the image quality is really pooor and the angle and composition could be better.</td>', 'cute scenario but the image quality is really pooor and the angle and composition could be better.', '2007-07-18 17:21:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915480, 556949, 73564, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and lighting, great smile, 6.</td>', 'Nice colors and lighting, great smile, 6.', '2007-07-18 17:21:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915482, 556785, 57456, '<td valign="top">The only problem I see with you photo is that for me, the light between the wooden planks seems to draw my attention to it and away from your stunning model. Very relaxed pose.</td>', 'The only problem I see with you photo is that for me, the light between the wooden planks seems to draw my attention to it and away from your stunning model. Very relaxed pose.', '2007-07-18 17:21:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915485, 555762, 47316, '<td valign="top">I like how you are looking through the brush but I think it might have worked a little better without it''s eye being onstructed. The colors seem really dull.</td>', 'I like how you are looking through the brush but I think it might have worked a little better without it''s eye being onstructed. The colors seem really dull.', '2007-07-18 17:22:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915486, 554811, 31637, '<td valign="top">That is some stylish beard for a homeless man. The detail here is superb and the funky background matches with your subject.</td>', 'That is some stylish beard for a homeless man. The detail here is superb and the funky background matches with your subject.', '2007-07-18 17:22:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915487, 556759, 39679, '<td valign="top">this is a nice shot but the white balance seems off to me.  A little two yellow.  Was that intentional?</td>', 'this is a nice shot but the white balance seems off to me.  A little two yellow.  Was that intentional?', '2007-07-18 17:22:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915488, 555045, 31637, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful model, the makeup on her is enchanting!</td>', 'What a beautiful model, the makeup on her is enchanting!', '2007-07-18 17:22:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915489, 555561, 73564, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, seems a little OOF, the lighting is nice, 5.</td>', 'Nice composition, seems a little OOF, the lighting is nice, 5.', '2007-07-18 17:23:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915492, 556555, 47316, '<td valign="top">lol! oh boy she is a mess! tears, snot, etc. This tells a story... though without more context I have no idea what the story is. I think this might have been better serves as a black and white, the sepia seems really orange in the highlight areas.</td>', 'lol! oh boy she is a mess! tears, snot, etc. This tells a story... though without more context I have no idea what the story is. I think this might have been better serves as a black and white, the sepia seems really orange in the highlight areas.', '2007-07-18 17:23:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915493, 555382, 31637, '<td valign="top">She does have bed hair, and looks like she just finished wrestling, is she really a nymph?</td>', 'She does have bed hair, and looks like she just finished wrestling, is she really a nymph?', '2007-07-18 17:23:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915494, 556532, 39679, '<td valign="top">I have to admit that this shot really did make me smile.  While technically not a perfect shot, you''ve done an really good job of capturing emotion.</td>', 'I have to admit that this shot really did make me smile.  While technically not a perfect shot, you''ve done an really good job of capturing emotion.', '2007-07-18 17:23:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915498, 556563, 33725, '<td valign="top">Bright background is distracting</td>', 'Bright background is distracting', '2007-07-18 17:24:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915499, 557027, 31637, '<td valign="top">great softness and sharpeness where it should be.</td>', 'great softness and sharpeness where it should be.', '2007-07-18 17:24:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915500, 556399, 47316, '<td valign="top">The DOF is nice, the focus seems really crisp oh her hair though when I''d prefer to see it on her eyes. The crop is way too close I think, it''s got that floating head feel. There is nothing really telling about her here, seems like she jst got caught not looking.</td>', 'The DOF is nice, the focus seems really crisp oh her hair though when I''d prefer to see it on her eyes. The crop is way too close I think, it''s got that floating head feel. There is nothing really telling about her here, seems like she jst got caught not looking.', '2007-07-18 17:24:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915504, 554928, 47316, '<td valign="top">I see the shadows but I don''t think they are strong enough fro what you wanted. Nothing really interesting here except for the soft colors.</td>', 'I see the shadows but I don''t think they are strong enough fro what you wanted. Nothing really interesting here except for the soft colors.', '2007-07-18 17:25:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915505, 556960, 57456, '<td valign="top">I really like how you composed this shot.</td>', 'I really like how you composed this shot.', '2007-07-18 17:26:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915508, 555323, 33725, '<td valign="top">Cropping the top of her head off bothers me.  Otherwise, this is very nice.</td>', 'Cropping the top of her head off bothers me.  Otherwise, this is very nice.', '2007-07-18 17:26:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915509, 555222, 31637, '<td valign="top">Cute, if they were walking in my neighborhood like that, they would definaly not dress like that. Is the one on the left wearing only tights? good photo but it''s a tight crop and too soft.</td>', 'Cute, if they were walking in my neighborhood like that, they would definaly not dress like that. Is the one on the left wearing only tights? good photo but it''s a tight crop and too soft.', '2007-07-18 17:26:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915512, 553635, 31637, '<td valign="top">Looks like Julia Stiles. Pretty.</td>', 'Looks like Julia Stiles. Pretty.', '2007-07-18 17:26:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915513, 557050, 33725, '<td valign="top">The hand in foreground looks washed out.</td>', 'The hand in foreground looks washed out.', '2007-07-18 17:27:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915515, 555166, 73564, '<td valign="top">Love the missing teeth, ads to the picture, great lighting, 7.</td>', 'Love the missing teeth, ads to the picture, great lighting, 7.', '2007-07-18 17:27:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915516, 557011, 47316, '<td valign="top">Ah! Now THIS is an animal portrait! This is superb! I love the crip detail, esp all the little wisker! The out of focus tree in the back is just enough of a background so it still feels natural and not like some stock shot on white. You have really captured this animal well, and I dont'' think that is an easy task. Great job and good luck!</td>', 'Ah! Now THIS is an animal portrait! This is superb! I love the crip detail, esp all the little wisker! The out of focus tree in the back is just enough of a background so it still feels natural and not like some stock shot on white. You have really captured this animal well, and I dont'' think that is an easy task. Great job and good luck!', '2007-07-18 17:27:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915519, 555828, 73564, '<td valign="top">I like this, you never see colored hair on an older person, great image, 6.</td>', 'I like this, you never see colored hair on an older person, great image, 6.', '2007-07-18 17:28:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915520, 556906, 57456, '<td valign="top">Very interesting photo. I would like some pointers as to how you managed the finished look you achieved. Her eyes jump right out at me.</td>', 'Very interesting photo. I would like some pointers as to how you managed the finished look you achieved. Her eyes jump right out at me.', '2007-07-18 17:28:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915524, 554307, 73564, '<td valign="top">Those eyes are WOW, very soft colors, nice, 7.</td>', 'Those eyes are WOW, very soft colors, nice, 7.', '2007-07-18 17:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915526, 556269, 47316, '<td valign="top">Cute simple portrait. Nice colors and even soft light. He seems to be in a pleasant, light mood. Might like to see this in black and white or even closer on the face. Also could have used a better title.</td>', 'Cute simple portrait. Nice colors and even soft light. He seems to be in a pleasant, light mood. Might like to see this in black and white or even closer on the face. Also could have used a better title.', '2007-07-18 17:29:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915527, 556764, 31637, '<td valign="top">I used to look like that....without the roids.</td>', 'I used to look like that....without the roids.', '2007-07-18 17:29:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915529, 554832, 57456, '<td valign="top">My initial thought upon seeing this photo was one of Drew Berrymore as a young girl in the movie "Fire Starter". Very intense eyes. Well done!</td>', 'My initial thought upon seeing this photo was one of Drew Berrymore as a young girl in the movie "Fire Starter". Very intense eyes. Well done!', '2007-07-18 17:29:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915531, 554577, 31637, '<td valign="top">This guy is cool! Nice use of light, although cant tell if natural or not.</td>', 'This guy is cool! Nice use of light, although cant tell if natural or not.', '2007-07-18 17:29:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915533, 554115, 47316, '<td valign="top">cute expression. light seems a bit dark on his face, also looks like there was too much editing done, looks way too smooth to me.</td>', 'cute expression. light seems a bit dark on his face, also looks like there was too much editing done, looks way too smooth to me.', '2007-07-18 17:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915534, 556507, 80311, '<td valign="top">Portrait?</td>', 'Portrait?', '2007-07-18 17:30:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915535, 556166, 73564, '<td valign="top">This person makes for an awesome picture, what character!! Nice choice, 7.</td>', 'This person makes for an awesome picture, what character!! Nice choice, 7.', '2007-07-18 17:30:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915536, 554741, 57456, '<td valign="top">This photo made me smile when I pulled it up. not sure, but the smile seems slightly forced to me, which makes it all the better.</td>', 'This photo made me smile when I pulled it up. not sure, but the smile seems slightly forced to me, which makes it all the better.', '2007-07-18 17:30:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915538, 555037, 73564, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, the lighting is very nice, 6.</td>', 'Nice picture, the lighting is very nice, 6.', '2007-07-18 17:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915539, 556166, 47316, '<td valign="top">Interesting capture. Lot of character in this. Might have liked to seen this in black and white, her skin tones on her face seem really harsh and orange from my view.</td>', 'Interesting capture. Lot of character in this. Might have liked to seen this in black and white, her skin tones on her face seem really harsh and orange from my view.', '2007-07-18 17:31:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915540, 555964, 57456, '<td valign="top">Soft, smooth skin and eyes which stand out very well. Impressive photo.</td>', 'Soft, smooth skin and eyes which stand out very well. Impressive photo.', '2007-07-18 17:31:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915542, 555056, 73564, '<td valign="top">Great capture, 6.</td>', 'Great capture, 6.', '2007-07-18 17:31:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915544, 555650, 47316, '<td valign="top">The lighting is pretty harsh, esp where it falls on his nose and the expression hessitant.</td>', 'The lighting is pretty harsh, esp where it falls on his nose and the expression hessitant.', '2007-07-18 17:32:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915546, 555852, 57456, '<td valign="top">Any tighter and the solid look you achieved would have been lost. Crisp and well done IMHO.</td>', 'Any tighter and the solid look you achieved would have been lost. Crisp and well done IMHO.', '2007-07-18 17:32:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915548, 556906, 73564, '<td valign="top">Very nice, the lighting is great, could have labled this Eve, 8.</td>', 'Very nice, the lighting is great, could have labled this Eve, 8.', '2007-07-18 17:32:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915552, 556782, 47316, '<td valign="top">The border really does a disservice to you here, it''s very distracting. As for the image, the tones seem a bit flat and the lighting isn''t the best. Not too much emotion is conveyed, I feel maybe... concentration.</td>', 'The border really does a disservice to you here, it''s very distracting. As for the image, the tones seem a bit flat and the lighting isn''t the best. Not too much emotion is conveyed, I feel maybe... concentration.', '2007-07-18 17:33:15.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3915554, 557072, 73564, '<td valign="top">Great lighting, nice picture, 7.</td>', 'Great lighting, nice picture, 7.', '2007-07-18 17:33:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915559, 554121, 80311, '<td valign="top">Incredible photo... but it is not a portrait???</td>', 'Incredible photo... but it is not a portrait???', '2007-07-18 17:34:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915563, 553900, 80311, '<td valign="top">Portrait???</td>', 'Portrait???', '2007-07-18 17:35:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915564, 556540, 73564, '<td valign="top">I hope this was taken in the submission dates, (ha ha) This image has an interesting look, even though it looks a bit OOF, it fits in a weird way, good work, 6.</td>', 'I hope this was taken in the submission dates, (ha ha) This image has an interesting look, even though it looks a bit OOF, it fits in a weird way, good work, 6.', '2007-07-18 17:35:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915567, 555100, 47316, '<td valign="top">Hmm... well this photo doesn''t say much to me about the subject. It''s like here I am, here is my camera. I think I''d prefer to see him using the camera or not have it there at all and get a portrait that conveys something from just him, says something about him. The image seems a bit dull and flat and real grainy on the right side.</td>', 'Hmm... well this photo doesn''t say much to me about the subject. It''s like here I am, here is my camera. I think I''d prefer to see him using the camera or not have it there at all and get a portrait that conveys something from just him, says something about him. The image seems a bit dull and flat and real grainy on the right side.', '2007-07-18 17:35:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915570, 553541, 57456, '<td valign="top">Very smooth skin and yet a crisp, clean photograph.</td>', 'Very smooth skin and yet a crisp, clean photograph.', '2007-07-18 17:36:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915573, 557050, 73564, '<td valign="top">Great image, the frame is a bit much, but it works, 6.</td>', 'Great image, the frame is a bit much, but it works, 6.', '2007-07-18 17:36:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915574, 557050, 47316, '<td valign="top">Hmm, strange image. With the tones and border Kind of reminds me of like an old snapshot you''d see of your parents. Is that his tong between his fingers? LOL. Funny little capture, it''s cute.</td>', 'Hmm, strange image. With the tones and border Kind of reminds me of like an old snapshot you''d see of your parents. Is that his tong between his fingers? LOL. Funny little capture, it''s cute.', '2007-07-18 17:36:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915576, 557049, 47316, '<td valign="top">You went much too saturated on the color, it''s overpowering your beautiful subject. She''s got adorable cheeks!</td>', 'You went much too saturated on the color, it''s overpowering your beautiful subject. She''s got adorable cheeks!', '2007-07-18 17:37:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915577, 556829, 73564, '<td valign="top">Nice image, the colors are great, 7.</td>', 'Nice image, the colors are great, 7.', '2007-07-18 17:38:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915579, 553850, 57456, '<td valign="top">Awesome teeth and clear skin. good use of light.</td>', 'Awesome teeth and clear skin. good use of light.', '2007-07-18 17:38:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915580, 556530, 73564, '<td valign="top">Nice image, the pose is great, 7.</td>', 'Nice image, the pose is great, 7.', '2007-07-18 17:39:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915582, 555222, 73564, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, the colors are nice as well, 6.</td>', 'Nice composition, the colors are nice as well, 6.', '2007-07-18 17:40:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915583, 556392, 47316, '<td valign="top">He''s adorable. I love when babies have those big open smiles! And his hands holding! So cute. The image though is really dark and flat and the angle is a little odd.</td>', 'He''s adorable. I love when babies have those big open smiles! And his hands holding! So cute. The image though is really dark and flat and the angle is a little odd.', '2007-07-18 17:40:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915585, 557048, 57456, '<td valign="top">Very impressive photo.</td>', 'Very impressive photo.', '2007-07-18 17:41:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915588, 557073, 57456, '<td valign="top">The light makes her stand out very well against the darkness of the stone.</td>', 'The light makes her stand out very well against the darkness of the stone.', '2007-07-18 17:41:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915592, 555875, 57456, '<td valign="top">Colors look very warm.</td>', 'Colors look very warm.', '2007-07-18 17:43:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915594, 553238, 57456, '<td valign="top">She has a very Demi Moore look to her. The lighting does this photo justice. Good job.</td>', 'She has a very Demi Moore look to her. The lighting does this photo justice. Good job.', '2007-07-18 17:44:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915597, 556898, 57456, '<td valign="top">A very soft, yet warm looking photo.</td>', 'A very soft, yet warm looking photo.', '2007-07-18 17:46:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915601, 555359, 78229, '<td valign="top">gorgeous!!! eyes are simply amazing.. 9!</td>', 'gorgeous!!! eyes are simply amazing.. 9!', '2007-07-18 17:48:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915603, 556519, 39679, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure why you chose to convert this to black and white - it really doesn''t add anything to the image.  Generally, it''s a nice shot and with the advanced editing rules you could have done a lot with it in color.</td>', 'I''m not sure why you chose to convert this to black and white - it really doesn''t add anything to the image.  Generally, it''s a nice shot and with the advanced editing rules you could have done a lot with it in color.', '2007-07-18 17:49:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915610, 554069, 39679, '<td valign="top">The composition of this shot is nice but it''s a little dark and (I''ve been asking this a lot in judging this challenge), why did you use black and white?  It doesn''t seem to add anything to the image.  It seems that this shot, portraying a relaxed feeling of comfort, would have been nice in muted/softened colors.</td>', 'The composition of this shot is nice but it''s a little dark and (I''ve been asking this a lot in judging this challenge), why did you use black and white?  It doesn''t seem to add anything to the image.  It seems that this shot, portraying a relaxed feeling of comfort, would have been nice in muted/softened colors.', '2007-07-18 17:52:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915619, 556877, 39679, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot.  Unfortunately her hair is in focus but her face is not.  I''m not if this was your intent but, to my eye, it''s distracting.  I find myself really wanting her face to be in focus.</td>', 'This is a nice shot.  Unfortunately her hair is in focus but her face is not.  I''m not if this was your intent but, to my eye, it''s distracting.  I find myself really wanting her face to be in focus.', '2007-07-18 17:55:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915637, 553891, 39679, '<td valign="top">Really nice shot but I''m not seeing that using black and white is really adding to the image.  I suspect that you probably had some really nice colors to work with.</td>', 'Really nice shot but I''m not seeing that using black and white is really adding to the image.  I suspect that you probably had some really nice colors to work with.', '2007-07-18 18:02:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915638, 557035, 772, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting photo, but the light hardly appears to be ''natural'' light, which is the point of this particular challenge.</td>', 'This is an interesting photo, but the light hardly appears to be ''natural'' light, which is the point of this particular challenge.', '2007-07-18 18:02:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915644, 557028, 78599, '<td valign="top">I dont like the border like that because it intercepts the subject. Cute kid:)</td>', 'I dont like the border like that because it intercepts the subject. Cute kid:)', '2007-07-18 18:03:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915646, 553839, 56539, '<td valign="top">This is not a Natural Light PORTRAIT.</td>', 'This is not a Natural Light PORTRAIT.', '2007-07-18 18:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915647, 554121, 78599, '<td valign="top">Well, I dont know what an unnatural sunset would be:P</td>', 'Well, I dont know what an unnatural sunset would be:P', '2007-07-18 18:05:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915649, 553512, 772, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept... The self portrait may be in natural light, but the light isn''t contributing much to the image itself.  Maybe it''s the processing that''s overriding the main theme of this particular challenge.</td>', 'Interesting concept... The self portrait may be in natural light, but the light isn''t contributing much to the image itself.  Maybe it''s the processing that''s overriding the main theme of this particular challenge.', '2007-07-18 18:05:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915652, 556219, 772, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent image, but the border really is too much.  I see this frequently on DPChallenge though and I''m slowly learning to deal with it.  A border should NEVER compete for attention with what''s inside it.</td>', 'This is an excellent image, but the border really is too much.  I see this frequently on DPChallenge though and I''m slowly learning to deal with it.  A border should NEVER compete for attention with what''s inside it.', '2007-07-18 18:06:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915656, 553221, 772, '<td valign="top">A darker shirt would have really set this off nicely... this is a very similar idea to the cover of this month''s Rangefinder...</td>', 'A darker shirt would have really set this off nicely... this is a very similar idea to the cover of this month''s Rangefinder...', '2007-07-18 18:07:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915660, 553287, 56539, '<td valign="top">This is not a natural light PORTRAIT.</td>', 'This is not a natural light PORTRAIT.', '2007-07-18 18:08:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915664, 554121, 56539, '<td valign="top">You''re pushing the envelope!  This is a landscape, not a portrait.</td>', 'You''re pushing the envelope!  This is a landscape, not a portrait.', '2007-07-18 18:10:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915668, 555222, 772, '<td valign="top">Las tres mujeres son muy blando.</td>', 'Las tres mujeres son muy blando.', '2007-07-18 18:11:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915671, 553541, 56539, '<td valign="top">Since this is an Advanced Editing, a little color cast correction would have improved the score.</td>', 'Since this is an Advanced Editing, a little color cast correction would have improved the score.', '2007-07-18 18:13:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915679, 555964, 78599, '<td valign="top">Wow beautiful model. Hauntingly beautiful...to be dramatic, but really she is:D</td>', 'Wow beautiful model. Hauntingly beautiful...to be dramatic, but really she is:D', '2007-07-18 18:15:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915683, 554328, 67258, '<td valign="top">Good play of light and well exposed.  A model with an interesting face - makes for a good portrait that holds my attention.  Looks like he may be suffering from a bit of hay-fever - the rather red eyes are slightly disconcerting, but at the same time add to the rugged out door look and make the photo interesting.</td>', 'Good play of light and well exposed.  A model with an interesting face - makes for a good portrait that holds my attention.  Looks like he may be suffering from a bit of hay-fever - the rather red eyes are slightly disconcerting, but at the same time add to the rugged out door look and make the photo interesting.', '2007-07-18 18:15:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915687, 555029, 56539, '<td valign="top">You''re pushing the envelope!  This is a landscape, not a portrait.</td>', 'You''re pushing the envelope!  This is a landscape, not a portrait.', '2007-07-18 18:17:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915689, 556222, 39679, '<td valign="top">Self portraits are so hard.   You did a nice job.  I''d like to see your shot a little brighter though.</td>', 'Self portraits are so hard.   You did a nice job.  I''d like to see your shot a little brighter though.', '2007-07-18 18:18:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915691, 556773, 48954, '<td valign="top">SILVERFOXX?</td>', 'SILVERFOXX?', '2007-07-18 18:19:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915692, 553071, 56539, '<td valign="top">This is not a portrait!</td>', 'This is not a portrait!', '2007-07-18 18:19:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915693, 555661, 67258, '<td valign="top">Pleasing portrait of a pretty girl.  The subdued colour palette suits the mood well.  My only gripe is that I am not altogether comfortable with the composition for the age of the child - the perspective doesn''t allow enough attention on her face.</td>', 'Pleasing portrait of a pretty girl.  The subdued colour palette suits the mood well.  My only gripe is that I am not altogether comfortable with the composition for the age of the child - the perspective doesn''t allow enough attention on her face.', '2007-07-18 18:19:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915695, 554183, 48954, '<td valign="top">alex?</td>', 'alex?', '2007-07-18 18:20:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915699, 554121, 45857, '<td valign="top">Portrait?</td>', 'Portrait?', '2007-07-18 18:22:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915716, 556210, 56539, '<td valign="top">You''re pushing the envelope.  This is a landscape, not a portrait.  I guess you expected to hear this.</td>', 'You''re pushing the envelope.  This is a landscape, not a portrait.  I guess you expected to hear this.', '2007-07-18 18:26:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915718, 555029, 45857, '<td valign="top">Portrait?</td>', 'Portrait?', '2007-07-18 18:27:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915723, 556730, 39679, '<td valign="top">This is going to seem like nit picking (sorry) but you''ve (or your model has) done a great job with her face makeup.  However, she has freckles on her hand and that was one of the first things I noticed.  There really is nothing wrong with adding a light base coat to a models hands (or shoulders, legs, whatever) to soften blemishes and freckles.  There certainly isn''t anything wrong with freckles but if you a such a clean face, the freckles on her hands really stand out.</td>', 'This is going to seem like nit picking (sorry) but you''ve (or your model has) done a great job with her face makeup.  However, she has freckles on her hand and that was one of the first things I noticed.  There really is nothing wrong with adding a light base coat to a models hands (or shoulders, legs, whatever) to soften blemishes and freckles.  There certainly isn''t anything wrong with freckles but if you a such a clean face, the freckles on her hands really stand out.', '2007-07-18 18:28:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915728, 556269, 67258, '<td valign="top">Good use of natural light and attractive lights in the eyes; strong diagonal composition and tight framing are good.  The wistful look is appealing, although the pose does look rather too staged.  That said, it is a lovely portrait.</td>', 'Good use of natural light and attractive lights in the eyes; strong diagonal composition and tight framing are good.  The wistful look is appealing, although the pose does look rather too staged.  That said, it is a lovely portrait.', '2007-07-18 18:28:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915732, 553756, 56539, '<td valign="top">In my opinion this is not a portrait and being OOF, is not a good photograph.</td>', 'In my opinion this is not a portrait and being OOF, is not a good photograph.', '2007-07-18 18:30:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915734, 553148, 67258, '<td valign="top">The light seems very harsh, although surprisingly there aren''t any shadows - very confusing!  Focus is soft, with little detail in terms of texture preserved.</td>', 'The light seems very harsh, although surprisingly there aren''t any shadows - very confusing!  Focus is soft, with little detail in terms of texture preserved.', '2007-07-18 18:31:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915736, 556507, 56539, '<td valign="top">Landscape, not as portrait.</td>', 'Landscape, not as portrait.', '2007-07-18 18:31:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915750, 555418, 56539, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t qualify as a portrait in my opinion.</td>', 'Doesn''t qualify as a portrait in my opinion.', '2007-07-18 18:36:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915763, 555183, 56539, '<td valign="top">He looks great at 94.</td>', 'He looks great at 94.', '2007-07-18 18:40:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915767, 553071, 45857, '<td valign="top">Portrait?</td>', 'Portrait?', '2007-07-18 18:40:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915783, 556219, 56539, '<td valign="top">Since this is an Advanced Editing challenge, a little color cast correction would help.</td>', 'Since this is an Advanced Editing challenge, a little color cast correction would help.', '2007-07-18 18:42:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915836, 553054, 39566, '<td valign="top">seems a little out of focus imo</td>', 'seems a little out of focus imo', '2007-07-18 18:55:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915837, 554317, 39566, '<td valign="top">very cute, seems to jump right out out ya</td>', 'very cute, seems to jump right out out ya', '2007-07-18 18:55:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915839, 556085, 39566, '<td valign="top">cute idea!</td>', 'cute idea!', '2007-07-18 18:56:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915842, 554521, 39566, '<td valign="top">imo i woule like it better if wasn''t so blured out</td>', 'imo i woule like it better if wasn''t so blured out', '2007-07-18 18:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915845, 553900, 56539, '<td valign="top">Not only is this not a portrait, there is lens flare and over exposure and OOF.</td>', 'Not only is this not a portrait, there is lens flare and over exposure and OOF.', '2007-07-18 18:58:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915847, 553850, 39566, '<td valign="top">maybe a little too much of a "plastic" look to her face...just my opionion...pretty model</td>', 'maybe a little too much of a "plastic" look to her face...just my opionion...pretty model', '2007-07-18 18:58:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915850, 556416, 39566, '<td valign="top">cute</td>', 'cute', '2007-07-18 18:59:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915851, 555732, 67258, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t appeal to me at all.  Little thought seems to have been given to the background, with the white of the dog''s coat merging in to the white of the duvet (?) - it may have been better to try and find some dark clothe to make a backdrop which would show the dog off better.</td>', 'This doesn''t appeal to me at all.  Little thought seems to have been given to the background, with the white of the dog''s coat merging in to the white of the duvet (?) - it may have been better to try and find some dark clothe to make a backdrop which would show the dog off better.', '2007-07-18 18:59:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915854, 555396, 39566, '<td valign="top">amazing...best one i''ve seen...good luck hope to see a ribbon with this 10</td>', 'amazing...best one i''ve seen...good luck hope to see a ribbon with this 10', '2007-07-18 19:01:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915862, 556532, 67258, '<td valign="top">He doesn''t look old enough to be a Grandpa!  Good exposure, composition and presentation.  I do wonder if less bright light would have meant that your model would have squinted less - that said,it is the lined face that makes the model,and the photograph, interesting.</td>', 'He doesn''t look old enough to be a Grandpa!  Good exposure, composition and presentation.  I do wonder if less bright light would have meant that your model would have squinted less - that said,it is the lined face that makes the model,and the photograph, interesting.', '2007-07-18 19:04:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915881, 555379, 67258, '<td valign="top">Certainly a refreshingly different take on the challenge.  My initial reaction is yes, I like it.  There is something vulnerable,almost frightened about the expression.  I am less sure about the perspective enlarged, upstretched hands; whilst they do lead the viewer in to the portrait, and are an essential part of the composition, I feel that they are a bit too prominent.  All in all, good work.</td>', 'Certainly a refreshingly different take on the challenge.  My initial reaction is yes, I like it.  There is something vulnerable,almost frightened about the expression.  I am less sure about the perspective enlarged, upstretched hands; whilst they do lead the viewer in to the portrait, and are an essential part of the composition, I feel that they are a bit too prominent.  All in all, good work.', '2007-07-18 19:08:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915894, 555661, 80096, '<td valign="top">Very nice.</td>', 'Very nice.', '2007-07-18 19:10:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915904, 556981, 78196, '<td valign="top">Wee bit over-edited for my taste, the editing on the subject''s face distracts me completely from his expression, which is a shame as you''ve obviously caught a great shot here.</td>', 'Wee bit over-edited for my taste, the editing on the subject''s face distracts me completely from his expression, which is a shame as you''ve obviously caught a great shot here.', '2007-07-18 19:13:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915911, 556389, 80096, '<td valign="top">Very Renaissance. Nice job.</td>', 'Very Renaissance. Nice job.', '2007-07-18 19:15:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915917, 557054, 78196, '<td valign="top">Terrific. Wonderful use of light. Having that much black space is quite daring; I like it, not sure everyone will.</td>', 'Terrific. Wonderful use of light. Having that much black space is quite daring; I like it, not sure everyone will.', '2007-07-18 19:16:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915928, 556085, 80912, '<td valign="top">Nicely framed by the bubble</td>', 'Nicely framed by the bubble', '2007-07-18 19:17:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915931, 556840, 80912, '<td valign="top">I like the use of thirds - in both directions!</td>', 'I like the use of thirds - in both directions!', '2007-07-18 19:17:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915934, 555221, 67258, '<td valign="top">The purplish colour caste around the hair is a bit of a shame, as it does detract from the photo.  Personally, I would prefer a less centred composition.</td>', 'The purplish colour caste around the hair is a bit of a shame, as it does detract from the photo.  Personally, I would prefer a less centred composition.', '2007-07-18 19:18:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915942, 557054, 80912, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure I like the uneven border, but the picture itself is lovely. Especially the texture of his skin.</td>', 'I''m not sure I like the uneven border, but the picture itself is lovely. Especially the texture of his skin.', '2007-07-18 19:19:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915943, 554790, 80096, '<td valign="top">Very soft, nicely done.</td>', 'Very soft, nicely done.', '2007-07-18 19:19:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915952, 556730, 80912, '<td valign="top">Her fingernails are oddly distracting, as is the spot to the left of her hand.</td>', 'Her fingernails are oddly distracting, as is the spot to the left of her hand.', '2007-07-18 19:20:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915957, 555427, 80912, '<td valign="top">Do you get extra points for using a DPC memeber as model? lol</td>', 'Do you get extra points for using a DPC memeber as model? lol', '2007-07-18 19:21:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915965, 555469, 67258, '<td valign="top">...and gorgeous curls!  A super model, and a good choice for a black and white study.</td>', '...and gorgeous curls!  A super model, and a good choice for a black and white study.', '2007-07-18 19:22:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915966, 556563, 11518, '<td valign="top">Eeeek freaky!  Nice light but the big blotches of highlight in the background are very distracting.</td>', 'Eeeek freaky!  Nice light but the big blotches of highlight in the background are very distracting.', '2007-07-18 19:22:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915968, 555640, 80912, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, but it looks a bit like a snapshot at a school function.</td>', 'I like the idea, but it looks a bit like a snapshot at a school function.', '2007-07-18 19:23:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915971, 557027, 11518, '<td valign="top">Beautiful bokeh, nice light, great exprression.</td>', 'Beautiful bokeh, nice light, great exprression.', '2007-07-18 19:23:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915981, 553563, 80096, '<td valign="top">You''ve captured the great character in his face. Well done.</td>', 'You''ve captured the great character in his face. Well done.', '2007-07-18 19:24:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915985, 556210, 80912, '<td valign="top">Not really a portrait - even of an inanimate object</td>', 'Not really a portrait - even of an inanimate object', '2007-07-18 19:25:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3915993, 556846, 67258, '<td valign="top">Hee, this one has made me smile!  Killer focus on the eye.  A fun portrait that  has an intimate feel.</td>', 'Hee, this one has made me smile!  Killer focus on the eye.  A fun portrait that  has an intimate feel.', '2007-07-18 19:26:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3916000, 554784, 80912, '<td valign="top">Love the composition</td>', 'Love the composition', '2007-07-18 19:28:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3916002, 555955, 67258, '<td valign="top">Lovely - certainly in the Librodo school of portraiture.  I just wonder whetehr a very small crop from the bottom would enhance the balance?</td>', 'Lovely - certainly in the Librodo school of portraiture.  I just wonder whetehr a very small crop from the bottom would enhance the balance?', '2007-07-18 19:28:43.000000', NULL, 1),
