(3917351, 556620, 44825, '<td valign="top">Nice shot but I find the models knees distract from the shot. IMO it may have been better to either crop the shot or perhaps have had the model stretch her legs so that it was only skirt in shot.</td>', 'Nice shot but I find the models knees distract from the shot. IMO it may have been better to either crop the shot or perhaps have had the model stretch her legs so that it was only skirt in shot.', '2007-07-19 02:49:38.000000', NULL, 1),
