(3917393, 556242, 73981, '<td valign="top">He looks old, but he''s been eating his veggies and taking in the protein. Nice shot! 7</td>', 'He looks old, but he''s been eating his veggies and taking in the protein. Nice shot! 7', '2007-07-19 03:07:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3917395, 556257, 73981, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. However, if I''m not mistaken, you used the blur and masked around the outside (If not, my mistake) and you left yourself a halo around the lady which I can see, and I think others will too. Perhaps next time you should use the select tool and select the area you want to blur so you don''t need to mask it out, and then it MAY leave less of a halo. Or you could go in a little closer if you had the time and patience to do it bit by bit. I would have also dodged the darker portions of the right side a bit more to bring out some detail. Otherwise, nice shot. 6</td>', 'Nice idea. However, if I''m not mistaken, you used the blur and masked around the outside (If not, my mistake) and you left yourself a halo around the lady which I can see, and I think others will too. Perhaps next time you should use the select tool and select the area you want to blur so you don''t need to mask it out, and then it MAY leave less of a halo. Or you could go in a little closer if you had the time and patience to do it bit by bit. I would have also dodged the darker portions of the right side a bit more to bring out some detail. Otherwise, nice shot. 6', '2007-07-19 03:11:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3917399, 556785, 73981, '<td valign="top">I wish my wife would let me take pictures like this of her. Hmmmm!! Gotta love the gratuitous nudity. Love the lighting coming through the wood panels. IMO I would have backed the model up into the corner a little more and gotten a tighter shot of her...or maybe that''s just the man in me hope for a closer shot of the goodies. 8</td>', 'I wish my wife would let me take pictures like this of her. Hmmmm!! Gotta love the gratuitous nudity. Love the lighting coming through the wood panels. IMO I would have backed the model up into the corner a little more and gotten a tighter shot of her...or maybe that''s just the man in me hope for a closer shot of the goodies. 8', '2007-07-19 03:16:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3917404, 553067, 73981, '<td valign="top">Sorry, not a fan of the way you processed this picture. 3</td>', 'Sorry, not a fan of the way you processed this picture. 3', '2007-07-19 03:17:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3917409, 556764, 79021, '<td valign="top">The shadow cast on the left side of his body is distracting.</td>', 'The shadow cast on the left side of his body is distracting.', '2007-07-19 03:25:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3917410, 556130, 62727, '<td valign="top">You are certainly evoking a lot of emotion here.  I have so many questions.  Who is this man?  Why is he so ematiated?  What is his life like?  Where does he live?  I hope you will share the details of this powerful image. 10</td>', 'You are certainly evoking a lot of emotion here.  I have so many questions.  Who is this man?  Why is he so ematiated?  What is his life like?  Where does he live?  I hope you will share the details of this powerful image. 10', '2007-07-19 03:26:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3917414, 553899, 62727, '<td valign="top">Joy.....captured perfectly!   I love the lighting, crop and expression!  10</td>', 'Joy.....captured perfectly!   I love the lighting, crop and expression!  10', '2007-07-19 03:28:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3917417, 556462, 62727, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous eyes and smile!  You did a great job of capturing this natural beauty. 8</td>', 'Gorgeous eyes and smile!  You did a great job of capturing this natural beauty. 8', '2007-07-19 03:32:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3917422, 556802, 79021, '<td valign="top">excellent candid</td>', 'excellent candid', '2007-07-19 03:34:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3917423, 555852, 62727, '<td valign="top">Wow!  This guy looks too good to be real!  Excellent photography-10</td>', 'Wow!  This guy looks too good to be real!  Excellent photography-10', '2007-07-19 03:35:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3917424, 557035, 67258, '<td valign="top">A sweet portrait - the inclusion of the bear adds enormously to the appeal. The curtain isn''t entirely in keeping with the portrait - if you can persuade your young model to cooperate in a re-shoot, how about trying it again with some net hung at the window?</td>', 'A sweet portrait - the inclusion of the bear adds enormously to the appeal. The curtain isn''t entirely in keeping with the portrait - if you can persuade your young model to cooperate in a re-shoot, how about trying it again with some net hung at the window?', '2007-07-19 03:35:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3917425, 555770, 79021, '<td valign="top">out of focus.  <br/>Is that a tear?  She doesn''t look upset, so that takes away from the impact of the picture</td>', 'out of focus.  Is that a tear?  She doesn''t look upset, so that takes away from the impact of the picture', '2007-07-19 03:36:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3917428, 556802, 62727, '<td valign="top">I love this image!  It looks like a candid, probably is.  Either way it''s gorgeous!  She looks lost in her own thoughts.</td>', 'I love this image!  It looks like a candid, probably is.  Either way it''s gorgeous!  She looks lost in her own thoughts.', '2007-07-19 03:37:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3917429, 556540, 79021, '<td valign="top">It looks like everything is out of focus except the earrings.  Is the processing supposed to make the portrait look old?    It doesn''t really work for me.</td>', 'It looks like everything is out of focus except the earrings.  Is the processing supposed to make the portrait look old?    It doesn''t really work for me.', '2007-07-19 03:38:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3917431, 557051, 67258, '<td valign="top">Harsh light has meant you have had to rely heavily on post-processing to bring the detail back in the shadow areas, resulting in a good deal of noise.</td>', 'Harsh light has meant you have had to rely heavily on post-processing to bring the detail back in the shadow areas, resulting in a good deal of noise.', '2007-07-19 03:39:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3917432, 555837, 79021, '<td valign="top">Well composed and definitely full of natural light.   My only problem with this is the models expression looks fake.</td>', 'Well composed and definitely full of natural light.   My only problem with this is the models expression looks fake.', '2007-07-19 03:40:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3917439, 555089, 79021, '<td valign="top">Interesting pose.  I like the background...</td>', 'Interesting pose.  I like the background...', '2007-07-19 03:47:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3917440, 556389, 62727, '<td valign="top">This is magical!  Can''t wait to read the details!</td>', 'This is magical!  Can''t wait to read the details!', '2007-07-19 03:48:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3917441, 553394, 79021, '<td valign="top">Way too much exposure...doesn''t work for me</td>', 'Way too much exposure...doesn''t work for me', '2007-07-19 03:48:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3917443, 557049, 67258, '<td valign="top">Very sweet and pleasing portrait. I do feel that you have gone just a little too far in the processing of the eyes - the whites are a little too white, and the shadows in the corner have taken on an orange tinge.  The child''s dark hair is shown off well against the green and orange background.</td>', 'Very sweet and pleasing portrait. I do feel that you have gone just a little too far in the processing of the eyes - the whites are a little too white, and the shadows in the corner have taken on an orange tinge.  The child''s dark hair is shown off well against the green and orange background.', '2007-07-19 03:49:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3917444, 556785, 67258, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of light!</td>', 'Excellent use of light!', '2007-07-19 03:50:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3917445, 555222, 79021, '<td valign="top">The girl in the middle has a blury face. The background doesn''t fit their choice of clothing.  Maybe if they all wore the same outfit this pic would be a little less random</td>', 'The girl in the middle has a blury face. The background doesn''t fit their choice of clothing.  Maybe if they all wore the same outfit this pic would be a little less random', '2007-07-19 03:51:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3917447, 556360, 79021, '<td valign="top">Too soft and the eyes are completely blacked out.</td>', 'Too soft and the eyes are completely blacked out.', '2007-07-19 03:52:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3917448, 555505, 79021, '<td valign="top">Reflection in the glasses is distracting.  I think showing more of the top of the head would have been more effective than the yellow shoulder in the lower left corner</td>', 'Reflection in the glasses is distracting.  I think showing more of the top of the head would have been more effective than the yellow shoulder in the lower left corner', '2007-07-19 03:53:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3917451, 555359, 79021, '<td valign="top">The background is nice and so is the hood.   The eyes (or atleast the right eye) stand out.  However, the shading on the face is oddly dark and somewhat grayish looking in places.</td>', 'The background is nice and so is the hood.   The eyes (or atleast the right eye) stand out.  However, the shading on the face is oddly dark and somewhat grayish looking in places.', '2007-07-19 03:55:26.000000', NULL, 1),
