(3917597, 555286, 58247, '<td valign="top">I really like the focus and DOF here, but feel the image needs to be brighter.</td>', 'I really like the focus and DOF here, but feel the image needs to be brighter.', '2007-07-19 07:04:47.000000', NULL, 1),
