(3917610, 553148, 64035, '<td valign="top">The focus is too loose for me, the dog (Hobbes?) is too soft. The general composition is pretty ho-hum too.</td>', 'The focus is too loose for me, the dog (Hobbes?) is too soft. The general composition is pretty ho-hum too.', '2007-07-19 07:21:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3917627, 557027, 70103, '<td valign="top">Great capture!!!</td>', 'Great capture!!!', '2007-07-19 07:54:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3917636, 555045, 9111, '<td valign="top">This is a gorgeous portrait of Fiona!!!  <br/> <br/>The only thing that I''d change is the tilt of her head a bit down to minimize the nostril area, as it detracts from her eyes</td>', 'This is a gorgeous portrait of Fiona!!!   The only thing that I''d change is the tilt of her head a bit down to minimize the nostril area, as it detracts from her eyes', '2007-07-19 08:04:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3917639, 556459, 64035, '<td valign="top">Lovely, simple photograph, beautifully taken. Her hair and eyes look gorgeous, the lighting is fabulous and the background echoes her eye colour fabulously. Top notch!</td>', 'Lovely, simple photograph, beautifully taken. Her hair and eyes look gorgeous, the lighting is fabulous and the background echoes her eye colour fabulously. Top notch!', '2007-07-19 08:09:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3917641, 553635, 64035, '<td valign="top">I love this photo. It''s beautifully composed and taken. The veil, in particular, gives such an air of mystery, and of hiding. The title is superb, too.</td>', 'I love this photo. It''s beautifully composed and taken. The veil, in particular, gives such an air of mystery, and of hiding. The title is superb, too.', '2007-07-19 08:10:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3917645, 556387, 67258, '<td valign="top">I like the idea behind this portrait, but do wish that the child was looking directly at the camera - that way she would echo the ''stare'' of the sunflower.  The background would be better if the trees weren''t visible - would you have been able to have a clear sky if you had taken the photo from 40 degrees or so clockwise?  Nonetheless, lovely skin tones.</td>', 'I like the idea behind this portrait, but do wish that the child was looking directly at the camera - that way she would echo the ''stare'' of the sunflower.  The background would be better if the trees weren''t visible - would you have been able to have a clear sky if you had taken the photo from 40 degrees or so clockwise?  Nonetheless, lovely skin tones.', '2007-07-19 08:16:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3917647, 556907, 67258, '<td valign="top">Oh gosh, this is lovely! Superb use of light, with excellent exposure and rendition of skin tones; bags of charm and character; super pose and composition; nice pleasing colour, and just enough hint of the background to add to the overall feel without distracting from the portrait. Delightful.</td>', 'Oh gosh, this is lovely! Superb use of light, with excellent exposure and rendition of skin tones; bags of charm and character; super pose and composition; nice pleasing colour, and just enough hint of the background to add to the overall feel without distracting from the portrait. Delightful.', '2007-07-19 08:19:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3917672, 555875, 59684, '<td valign="top">I love the softness of this one</td>', 'I love the softness of this one', '2007-07-19 08:47:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3917675, 555351, 59684, '<td valign="top">Cute kid, love the pic aswell the eyes specialy</td>', 'Cute kid, love the pic aswell the eyes specialy', '2007-07-19 08:51:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3917676, 555396, 64035, '<td valign="top">Great image - lovely and sharp around the eyes and glasses. Great pose, great splash of red in amongst an image that''s otherwise almost black and white.</td>', 'Great image - lovely and sharp around the eyes and glasses. Great pose, great splash of red in amongst an image that''s otherwise almost black and white.', '2007-07-19 08:52:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3917677, 553238, 59684, '<td valign="top">Good pic, very bright and sharp. But the background is to distracting.</td>', 'Good pic, very bright and sharp. But the background is to distracting.', '2007-07-19 08:53:17.000000', NULL, 1),
