(3918829, 554808, 81390, '<td valign="top">Her expression doesn''t mesh with the sharpness. She looks friendly while her hair and cheeks look like they might attack me. The light worked out a little wonky with the shadows crossing her face, but I do like that her eyes stand out so much. Nice color.</td>', 'Her expression doesn''t mesh with the sharpness. She looks friendly while her hair and cheeks look like they might attack me. The light worked out a little wonky with the shadows crossing her face, but I do like that her eyes stand out so much. Nice color.', '2007-07-19 16:08:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3918833, 554041, 81390, '<td valign="top">Good job dealing with direct overhead light. I''d like to see more of their eyes, though. Their personalities come straight across, I like that you captured both.</td>', 'Good job dealing with direct overhead light. I''d like to see more of their eyes, though. Their personalities come straight across, I like that you captured both.', '2007-07-19 16:11:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3918839, 556761, 81390, '<td valign="top">They both seem to emerge from an indistinguishable stump. Even jacking up the brightness on my monitor doesn''t separate them. Cute photo, but there needs to be more emphasis on the faces than the hands.</td>', 'They both seem to emerge from an indistinguishable stump. Even jacking up the brightness on my monitor doesn''t separate them. Cute photo, but there needs to be more emphasis on the faces than the hands.', '2007-07-19 16:13:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3918841, 555351, 81390, '<td valign="top">Atypical. I like it! Much more representative of a young boy than the angelic studio portraits I too often see.</td>', 'Atypical. I like it! Much more representative of a young boy than the angelic studio portraits I too often see.', '2007-07-19 16:14:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3918856, 555347, 32767, '<td valign="top">This has potential. I really like what you are showing me but the PP looks off. Something strange about the eyes? I''m not certain if this is right or wrong but I believe it''s generally not good form to cut off the chin.</td>', 'This has potential. I really like what you are showing me but the PP looks off. Something strange about the eyes? I''m not certain if this is right or wrong but I believe it''s generally not good form to cut off the chin.', '2007-07-19 16:19:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3918864, 557060, 81390, '<td valign="top">This was an interruption in a stream of "click... examine... rate..." where I saw it and my brain literally went, "Ooh." It''s her face that does it. This is excellent portrait photography. A real person doing a real thing.<br/> <br/>It also rewards second glances. Her blue fingernails are a fun treat to find, and that charm is pretty. And the cloth on the bottom right would be a nuisance, but I tried blocking it out and it keeps her from looking like she''s falling over.</td>', 'This was an interruption in a stream of "click... examine... rate..." where I saw it and my brain literally went, "Ooh." It''s her face that does it. This is excellent portrait photography. A real person doing a real thing. It also rewards second glances. Her blue fingernails are a fun treat to find, and that charm is pretty. And the cloth on the bottom right would be a nuisance, but I tried blocking it out and it keeps her from looking like she''s falling over.', '2007-07-19 16:24:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3918865, 555254, 81390, '<td valign="top">Creative choice of subject! If you''d actually thrown in a strawberry it would be adorable, but on second thought, the way his head is tilted like he''s asking you for a strawberry is pretty sweet. All it needs is for the focus to move up a little, since it missed his face and landed on the mat, sadly. And that green blob could be removed, for better unity of color.<br/> <br/>But man, I really do like hedgehogs.</td>', 'Creative choice of subject! If you''d actually thrown in a strawberry it would be adorable, but on second thought, the way his head is tilted like he''s asking you for a strawberry is pretty sweet. All it needs is for the focus to move up a little, since it missed his face and landed on the mat, sadly. And that green blob could be removed, for better unity of color. But man, I really do like hedgehogs.', '2007-07-19 16:24:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3918866, 556733, 81390, '<td valign="top">I had to stare at this for quite a while before I could figure out what to say. I still don''t know. But she''s so genuine... and that title fits well, because her age and facial expression make her look to be on the verge of sudden, profoud maturity. There isn''t a thing about this photo I''d change.</td>', 'I had to stare at this for quite a while before I could figure out what to say. I still don''t know. But she''s so genuine... and that title fits well, because her age and facial expression make her look to be on the verge of sudden, profoud maturity. There isn''t a thing about this photo I''d change.', '2007-07-19 16:25:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3918871, 554115, 81390, '<td valign="top">The angle of the background is neat, and I like the colors overall. His face looks kind of plastic, though, the way his eyes and mouth pop out all sharp against very smooth skin and eyebrows.</td>', 'The angle of the background is neat, and I like the colors overall. His face looks kind of plastic, though, the way his eyes and mouth pop out all sharp against very smooth skin and eyebrows.', '2007-07-19 16:27:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3918874, 556877, 81390, '<td valign="top">I love that the focus is on the hair and not the eyes, but this still definitely counts as a portrait for me. It''s something different, but it shows you what a portrait is supposed to show.</td>', 'I love that the focus is on the hair and not the eyes, but this still definitely counts as a portrait for me. It''s something different, but it shows you what a portrait is supposed to show.', '2007-07-19 16:28:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3918890, 556929, 81390, '<td valign="top">This would be endearing if it didn''t look like he''s just murdered his pacifier. The direct side lighting sort of blew out a little of his face, but it caught in his eyes nicely.</td>', 'This would be endearing if it didn''t look like he''s just murdered his pacifier. The direct side lighting sort of blew out a little of his face, but it caught in his eyes nicely.', '2007-07-19 16:34:53.000000', NULL, 1),
