(3918945, 554856, 54885, '<td valign="top">this is an excellent capture, the light on the top of his head is a little distracting..maybe if you had taken this photo with your model facing the light. I still love this photo and I am not an expert..just commenting on what I see.</td>', 'this is an excellent capture, the light on the top of his head is a little distracting..maybe if you had taken this photo with your model facing the light. I still love this photo and I am not an expert..just commenting on what I see.', '2007-07-19 16:52:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3918952, 556761, 54885, '<td valign="top">I love this pose, I think this photo could be cropped a little more to bring more focus in on the models..excellent lighting</td>', 'I love this pose, I think this photo could be cropped a little more to bring more focus in on the models..excellent lighting', '2007-07-19 16:53:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3918956, 556519, 54885, '<td valign="top">I really love this alot. Maybe a little more cropping or taking this photo off centered would really kick up the impact. The lighting and treatment is wonderful</td>', 'I really love this alot. Maybe a little more cropping or taking this photo off centered would really kick up the impact. The lighting and treatment is wonderful', '2007-07-19 16:55:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3918966, 556723, 54885, '<td valign="top">Excellent. The only thing I would change would be the size..the size is too small. Love the overall photo..great lighting and the clarity is right on key</td>', 'Excellent. The only thing I would change would be the size..the size is too small. Love the overall photo..great lighting and the clarity is right on key', '2007-07-19 16:56:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3918969, 556392, 81390, '<td valign="top">It''s very... blue. Since it''s advanced editing, that''s not a huge deal to change unless you''re somewhere without software. Also, even though it''s a portrait, more negative space would help here. The crop is a little close, so it looks like anyone''s baby picture more than artistic photography.<br/> <br/>Cute pose and face. If he''s yours, congratulations on such a sweetheart - he at least looks the part.</td>', 'It''s very... blue. Since it''s advanced editing, that''s not a huge deal to change unless you''re somewhere without software. Also, even though it''s a portrait, more negative space would help here. The crop is a little close, so it looks like anyone''s baby picture more than artistic photography. Cute pose and face. If he''s yours, congratulations on such a sweetheart - he at least looks the part.', '2007-07-19 16:57:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3918972, 556799, 54885, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done..really shows her wonderful character</td>', 'Beautifully done..really shows her wonderful character', '2007-07-19 16:58:06.000000', NULL, 1),
