(3919057, 555418, 67841, '<td valign="top">ha ha ha  - my only critiques would be that I don''t care for the centered composition here &amp; a different background might have been more appealing... &lt;&lt; 7 &gt;&gt;</td>', 'ha ha ha  - my only critiques would be that I don''t care for the centered composition here & a different background might have been more appealing... << 7 >>', '2007-07-19 17:15:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3919074, 556130, 67841, '<td valign="top">wow - deeply emotive.  intriguing textures &amp; the fact that his eyes are hidden adds an interesting element...</td>', 'wow - deeply emotive.  intriguing textures & the fact that his eyes are hidden adds an interesting element...', '2007-07-19 17:20:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3919079, 556837, 67841, '<td valign="top">I don''t care for the composition &amp; the title seems disconnected to their emotion.  The lighting &amp; post treatment is nice, though.</td>', 'I don''t care for the composition & the title seems disconnected to their emotion.  The lighting & post treatment is nice, though.', '2007-07-19 17:22:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3919084, 556399, 67841, '<td valign="top">composition seems unbalanced &amp; the focus is sharper on her hair than her face/eyes.  &lt;&lt; 5 &gt;&gt;</td>', 'composition seems unbalanced & the focus is sharper on her hair than her face/eyes.  << 5 >>', '2007-07-19 17:24:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3919085, 555037, 67841, '<td valign="top">nice candid.</td>', 'nice candid.', '2007-07-19 17:25:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3919091, 556456, 67841, '<td valign="top">Personally, I don''t think candles count as ''natural light'' - they''re still a lighting device, IMHO, so this is a DNMC for me.  I''ll give you a few points for execution...</td>', 'Personally, I don''t think candles count as ''natural light'' - they''re still a lighting device, IMHO, so this is a DNMC for me.  I''ll give you a few points for execution...', '2007-07-19 17:27:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3919093, 555181, 67841, '<td valign="top">awesome colors &amp; excellent execution!  &lt;&lt; 8 &gt;&gt;</td>', 'awesome colors & excellent execution!  << 8 >>', '2007-07-19 17:27:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3919104, 556242, 67841, '<td valign="top">A little bright for my liking - some vignetting might have quelled that and cut down on the busy-ness, too, helping to distinguish the subject from his surroundings even more.  The emotional level of the photo is quite high &amp; the texture compels you to examine the moment - which is nice...  &lt;&lt; 6 &gt;&gt;</td>', 'A little bright for my liking - some vignetting might have quelled that and cut down on the busy-ness, too, helping to distinguish the subject from his surroundings even more.  The emotional level of the photo is quite high & the texture compels you to examine the moment - which is nice...  << 6 >>', '2007-07-19 17:32:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3919121, 555732, 9462, '<td valign="top">Sorry to say but that is one scary ugly dog but I''m sure he/she is a sweetie.<br/> <br/>The background &amp; foreground are not complimentary.</td>', 'Sorry to say but that is one scary ugly dog but I''m sure he/she is a sweetie. The background & foreground are not complimentary.', '2007-07-19 17:37:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3919137, 555706, 9462, '<td valign="top">Your editing has given this a dreamy feel making the infant look more like a porcelain doll than an actual child; a bit over the top for my taste.<br/> <br/>Congratulations on your new addition.</td>', 'Your editing has given this a dreamy feel making the infant look more like a porcelain doll than an actual child; a bit over the top for my taste. Congratulations on your new addition.', '2007-07-19 17:41:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3919141, 553850, 48268, '<td valign="top">She has unnaturally bright teeth</td>', 'She has unnaturally bright teeth', '2007-07-19 17:42:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3919154, 553288, 9462, '<td valign="top">The dog, which is the main focal point is out of focus. The centered composition does not work. If he were to the left it would draw the viewer to look out at the expansive scenery with him.</td>', 'The dog, which is the main focal point is out of focus. The centered composition does not work. If he were to the left it would draw the viewer to look out at the expansive scenery with him.', '2007-07-19 17:45:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3919176, 556843, 9462, '<td valign="top">She looks jaundiced. Bringing down the reds and increasing the blues in the highlights would''ve given this a bit wider color range while keeping that sunset light in tack.<br/> <br/>The headphones are an unnecessary distraction, unless of course this is an advert.</td>', 'She looks jaundiced. Bringing down the reds and increasing the blues in the highlights would''ve given this a bit wider color range while keeping that sunset light in tack. The headphones are an unnecessary distraction, unless of course this is an advert.', '2007-07-19 17:51:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3919181, 554072, 67841, '<td valign="top">Very nice - spectacular tones &amp; detail...</td>', 'Very nice - spectacular tones & detail...', '2007-07-19 17:53:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3919182, 554808, 46570, '<td valign="top">What a lovely capture of a beautiful young lady with 2 different colored eyes.</td>', 'What a lovely capture of a beautiful young lady with 2 different colored eyes.', '2007-07-19 17:54:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3919195, 556459, 78196, '<td valign="top">There''s something a bit Kirsten Dunst about your model! Well taken and excellent use of the blue background to highlight her stunning eyes.</td>', 'There''s something a bit Kirsten Dunst about your model! Well taken and excellent use of the blue background to highlight her stunning eyes.', '2007-07-19 17:56:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3919200, 555396, 42100, '<td valign="top">Very cool POV...really works well with the high-key look(it''s high-key to me, maybe I''m wrong).  Flawless indeed!</td>', 'Very cool POV...really works well with the high-key look(it''s high-key to me, maybe I''m wrong).  Flawless indeed!', '2007-07-19 17:57:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3919205, 556965, 78196, '<td valign="top">You could have really done with a reflector here to highlight the face a little.</td>', 'You could have really done with a reflector here to highlight the face a little.', '2007-07-19 17:58:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3919214, 556049, 9462, '<td valign="top">A leveled photograph would be beneficial. <br/>You''ve also lost quite a bit of quality. 24kb is too small to do any photo justice.</td>', 'A leveled photograph would be beneficial. You''ve also lost quite a bit of quality. 24kb is too small to do any photo justice.', '2007-07-19 18:02:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3919224, 557068, 9462, '<td valign="top">The blown out (overexposed) fur and the collar are annoying. The border is pointless and not complimentary.<br/> <br/>Beautiful cat :)</td>', 'The blown out (overexposed) fur and the collar are annoying. The border is pointless and not complimentary. Beautiful cat :)', '2007-07-19 18:05:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3919231, 556540, 9462, '<td valign="top">It''s generally a good idea for the eyes to be the sharpest and in focus part of a portrait.</td>', 'It''s generally a good idea for the eyes to be the sharpest and in focus part of a portrait.', '2007-07-19 18:08:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3919232, 556283, 42100, '<td valign="top">The artistic tilt on this seems to be just right...it really places the eyes in just the right place within the composition.  Nice job on the eyes by the way, like brilliant gems, but not too over the top.</td>', 'The artistic tilt on this seems to be just right...it really places the eyes in just the right place within the composition.  Nice job on the eyes by the way, like brilliant gems, but not too over the top.', '2007-07-19 18:08:20.000000', NULL, 1),
