(3919237, 553485, 42100, '<td valign="top">Great b&amp;w tones...perfects range and shades of grey.  Really nice job of capturing this mans character.  Well done!</td>', 'Great b&w tones...perfects range and shades of grey.  Really nice job of capturing this mans character.  Well done!', '2007-07-19 18:10:43.000000', NULL, 1),
