(3919387, 553238, 61818, '<td valign="top">Sexy shot.  Only things that bug me are the bright spot on the forehead and the messy hair along the arms.  Obviously it''s not a glamor shot, but to my eye it would have more impact without the messy hair distracting my eye.  Good luck!</td>', 'Sexy shot.  Only things that bug me are the bright spot on the forehead and the messy hair along the arms.  Obviously it''s not a glamor shot, but to my eye it would have more impact without the messy hair distracting my eye.  Good luck!', '2007-07-19 18:53:42.000000', NULL, 1),
