(3919395, 554532, 61818, '<td valign="top">Really nice, wonderful composition and tones.  Dead perfect dof too, just a hint of a fence back there to give the shot context.</td>', 'Really nice, wonderful composition and tones.  Dead perfect dof too, just a hint of a fence back there to give the shot context.', '2007-07-19 18:56:02.000000', NULL, 1),
