(3919687, 556354, 77196, '<td valign="top">Your use of reflection here, while maintaining the illusion of a normal room through the placement of the corner is excellent. In addition, the tones and colors blend very nicely, and your model looks like someone that would be fun to know. As if all of that wasn''t enough, the light reflected in her eyes make them sparkle!</td>', 'Your use of reflection here, while maintaining the illusion of a normal room through the placement of the corner is excellent. In addition, the tones and colors blend very nicely, and your model looks like someone that would be fun to know. As if all of that wasn''t enough, the light reflected in her eyes make them sparkle!', '2007-07-19 21:09:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3919688, 556222, 77196, '<td valign="top">Interesting choice of vertical blinds for the background and a striped top. I''d have like to see more light on the hair.</td>', 'Interesting choice of vertical blinds for the background and a striped top. I''d have like to see more light on the hair.', '2007-07-19 21:11:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3919689, 556507, 77196, '<td valign="top">Your subject is distant and out of focus. The photo is also on the grainy side.</td>', 'Your subject is distant and out of focus. The photo is also on the grainy side.', '2007-07-19 21:14:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3919698, 554942, 77196, '<td valign="top">Too light - you might have gotten away with the face, but when the neck also washes out, it comes across as too much. This is a great eyes shot and a very nice crop.</td>', 'Too light - you might have gotten away with the face, but when the neck also washes out, it comes across as too much. This is a great eyes shot and a very nice crop.', '2007-07-19 21:20:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3919702, 554043, 77196, '<td valign="top">Too dark. Virtually half your photo is black with no detail. Your main subject is difficult to see, leaving nothing to draw your viewer in.</td>', 'Too dark. Virtually half your photo is black with no detail. Your main subject is difficult to see, leaving nothing to draw your viewer in.', '2007-07-19 21:21:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3919704, 555698, 62727, '<td valign="top">Love it!  Great angle and background for this! 8</td>', 'Love it!  Great angle and background for this! 8', '2007-07-19 21:23:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3919705, 557041, 77196, '<td valign="top">Never been a fan of face half shadow / half light. You''ve captured nice skin tones and a neutral expression. The flower behind the ear is a nice touch, and adds some color to the upper part of the photo.</td>', 'Never been a fan of face half shadow / half light. You''ve captured nice skin tones and a neutral expression. The flower behind the ear is a nice touch, and adds some color to the upper part of the photo.', '2007-07-19 21:23:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3919709, 555379, 77196, '<td valign="top">If you were going for scary, you succeeded. Hands this close together, reaching out like this is often perceived as threatening. This is augmented by the hands being out of focus while the fact &amp; body are in sharp focus. Add in the unreadable expression and you have a very unsettling image. This image makes very nice use of sand as the background.</td>', 'If you were going for scary, you succeeded. Hands this close together, reaching out like this is often perceived as threatening. This is augmented by the hands being out of focus while the fact & body are in sharp focus. Add in the unreadable expression and you have a very unsettling image. This image makes very nice use of sand as the background.', '2007-07-19 21:27:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3919711, 556007, 77196, '<td valign="top">Nice action shot. Is this a portrait?</td>', 'Nice action shot. Is this a portrait?', '2007-07-19 21:28:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3919716, 555029, 77196, '<td valign="top">Tough lighting. You wound up with the island overexposed and the sky/water (especially in the upper right corner) underexposed. Is this a portrait?</td>', 'Tough lighting. You wound up with the island overexposed and the sky/water (especially in the upper right corner) underexposed. Is this a portrait?', '2007-07-19 21:30:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3919717, 554072, 77196, '<td valign="top">Tilted heads for no apparent reason don''t help a photo. What great blue eyes. Not sure sans-clothes helps this shot.</td>', 'Tilted heads for no apparent reason don''t help a photo. What great blue eyes. Not sure sans-clothes helps this shot.', '2007-07-19 21:31:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3919720, 556942, 77196, '<td valign="top">Overexposed &amp; probably could have been darkened a bit in post processing.</td>', 'Overexposed & probably could have been darkened a bit in post processing.', '2007-07-19 21:32:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3919723, 555034, 77196, '<td valign="top">Love the freckles, red hair, and smile.</td>', 'Love the freckles, red hair, and smile.', '2007-07-19 21:32:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3919725, 555521, 77196, '<td valign="top">I think you could have lost most of the empty brick on the left without hurting the shot. A great "attitude" shot and the monochrome is a plus on this one. The boys looking in the same direction, but away from the camera add to the "attitude".</td>', 'I think you could have lost most of the empty brick on the left without hurting the shot. A great "attitude" shot and the monochrome is a plus on this one. The boys looking in the same direction, but away from the camera add to the "attitude".', '2007-07-19 21:34:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3919726, 553686, 77196, '<td valign="top">Too Overexposed</td>', 'Too Overexposed', '2007-07-19 21:35:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3919729, 556257, 77196, '<td valign="top">Too dark - lightening it a bit to clarify the face and a tighter crop on the left would improve this shot.</td>', 'Too dark - lightening it a bit to clarify the face and a tighter crop on the left would improve this shot.', '2007-07-19 21:36:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3919738, 556838, 77196, '<td valign="top">What a cute shot (and, I''m sure a precious moment). The photo has a high level of graininess - especially noticeable in the girl''s face, shirt, pants, and background at the left of the photo. This really, really hurts the quality of this photo. Many digitals (Fuji is especially naughty about this) crank the ISO up way high automatically (like ISO-1600 or ISO-3200) to allow you to shoot in lower light - at the expense of photo quality. When you sharpen, it only makes it worse.</td>', 'What a cute shot (and, I''m sure a precious moment). The photo has a high level of graininess - especially noticeable in the girl''s face, shirt, pants, and background at the left of the photo. This really, really hurts the quality of this photo. Many digitals (Fuji is especially naughty about this) crank the ISO up way high automatically (like ISO-1600 or ISO-3200) to allow you to shoot in lower light - at the expense of photo quality. When you sharpen, it only makes it worse.', '2007-07-19 21:39:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3919740, 556339, 77196, '<td valign="top">Mouths open wide are, generally, not attractive - unless you''re a dentist and they''re a paying customer.</td>', 'Mouths open wide are, generally, not attractive - unless you''re a dentist and they''re a paying customer.', '2007-07-19 21:40:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3919746, 555955, 77196, '<td valign="top">An otherwise excellent photo is destroyed by an out of focus bottom 1/3 - which is, unfortunately, where the observer''s eye is drawn. I don''t know what it is - but you may have had a top ribbon if it was cropped just below the chin. The light on the veil makes it look like metal mesh, and this is accented by the metallic lipstick and almost-metallic look to the skin. But the topper is that marvelous metallic reflection / glint in her visible eye.</td>', 'An otherwise excellent photo is destroyed by an out of focus bottom 1/3 - which is, unfortunately, where the observer''s eye is drawn. I don''t know what it is - but you may have had a top ribbon if it was cropped just below the chin. The light on the veil makes it look like metal mesh, and this is accented by the metallic lipstick and almost-metallic look to the skin. But the topper is that marvelous metallic reflection / glint in her visible eye.', '2007-07-19 21:44:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3919748, 556822, 77196, '<td valign="top">Everything looks out of focus. If it had been in focus, you may want to consider cropping it just in front of the girl in yellow.</td>', 'Everything looks out of focus. If it had been in focus, you may want to consider cropping it just in front of the girl in yellow.', '2007-07-19 21:46:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3919821, 556785, 81530, '<td valign="top">Good shot. I find that the pillow decorations distract from the main subject. I would love to see this shot with the interior room a little darker.</td>', 'Good shot. I find that the pillow decorations distract from the main subject. I would love to see this shot with the interior room a little darker.', '2007-07-19 22:15:47.000000', NULL, 1),
