(3920332, 555543, 66384, '<td valign="top">What a pretty girl. You captured her sparkle. She looks like the sort of person who can do anything she sets her mind to.</td>', 'What a pretty girl. You captured her sparkle. She looks like the sort of person who can do anything she sets her mind to.', '2007-07-20 00:30:54.000000', NULL, 1),
