(3921551, 557073, 65319, '<td valign="top">You captured the ethereal beauty here to perfection.  Truly, an absolutely lovely photo.</td>', 'You captured the ethereal beauty here to perfection.  Truly, an absolutely lovely photo.', '2007-07-20 12:26:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3921562, 555852, 65319, '<td valign="top">Intense doesn''t even begin to describe this portrait.  I feel there''s a whole story here... and a mystery at the same time.  Well done!</td>', 'Intense doesn''t even begin to describe this portrait.  I feel there''s a whole story here... and a mystery at the same time.  Well done!', '2007-07-20 12:29:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3921575, 555167, 65319, '<td valign="top">"Come into my parlour..." said the spider to the fly.  Heh...so where''s the fly?!!! Terrific macro!  I love the black / white and transparency in color.  Well done!</td>', '"Come into my parlour..." said the spider to the fly.  Heh...so where''s the fly?!!! Terrific macro!  I love the black / white and transparency in color.  Well done!', '2007-07-20 12:34:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3921587, 554907, 60657, '<td valign="top">This photograph moved me. Great composition, you filled the frame, isolated the subjects... I can almost see the connection between their eyes. The image could be a bit warmer though. Good stuff!</td>', 'This photograph moved me. Great composition, you filled the frame, isolated the subjects... I can almost see the connection between their eyes. The image could be a bit warmer though. Good stuff!', '2007-07-20 12:39:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3921597, 554832, 60657, '<td valign="top">I just couldn''t take my eyes away from this one. Has some sort of mysticism about what the subject is thinking at the time. The sharp focus on the face and the softness elsewhere adds to this effect. Nice work.</td>', 'I just couldn''t take my eyes away from this one. Has some sort of mysticism about what the subject is thinking at the time. The sharp focus on the face and the softness elsewhere adds to this effect. Nice work.', '2007-07-20 12:45:57.000000', NULL, 1),
