(3922230, 556800, 67258, '<td valign="top">An effective candid portrait - excellent composition, and one of those rare occasions when a tilt truly works.  The naturalness of your model is remarkable (and if it is a candid it is all the more impressive).</td>', 'An effective candid portrait - excellent composition, and one of those rare occasions when a tilt truly works.  The naturalness of your model is remarkable (and if it is a candid it is all the more impressive).', '2007-07-20 16:06:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3922237, 556947, 67258, '<td valign="top">Lovely soft and even skin tones - you obviously have a very good understanding of light, and some considerable skill in using it to best advantage!</td>', 'Lovely soft and even skin tones - you obviously have a very good understanding of light, and some considerable skill in using it to best advantage!', '2007-07-20 16:08:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3922246, 556787, 67258, '<td valign="top">He does seem very serious - and a touch sad, too! I am not keen on the striped background, finding it somewhat distracting, but you have captured a good portrait.</td>', 'He does seem very serious - and a touch sad, too! I am not keen on the striped background, finding it somewhat distracting, but you have captured a good portrait.', '2007-07-20 16:11:58.000000', NULL, 1),
