(3922257, 555762, 67258, '<td valign="top">Focus is rather soft; the twigs in front of the cat''s face are distracting.  I have no idea if capturing photos of Wild Cats is difficult, but in any case,as a portrait, this doesn''t work for me.</td>', 'Focus is rather soft; the twigs in front of the cat''s face are distracting.  I have no idea if capturing photos of Wild Cats is difficult, but in any case,as a portrait, this doesn''t work for me.', '2007-07-20 16:17:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3922273, 555382, 67258, '<td valign="top">The play of light on your model''s hair is gorgeous, and I do lie the composition very much.  I am less keen on the seeming colour caste on the model''s face.</td>', 'The play of light on your model''s hair is gorgeous, and I do lie the composition very much.  I am less keen on the seeming colour caste on the model''s face.', '2007-07-20 16:24:22.000000', NULL, 1),
