(3922292, 555479, 67258, '<td valign="top">This is very lovely,and a portrait most parents would love to have of their little girl!  Your use of light is exceptionally good, and the exposure spot on.  My only caveat is that the way the selective desaturation gives the photo something of a feel of a portrait taken in front of a poster size photo.</td>', 'This is very lovely,and a portrait most parents would love to have of their little girl!  Your use of light is exceptionally good, and the exposure spot on.  My only caveat is that the way the selective desaturation gives the photo something of a feel of a portrait taken in front of a poster size photo.', '2007-07-20 16:29:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3922296, 555418, 57060, '<td valign="top">hahaha, good one<br/>7<br/>Jack</td>', 'hahaha, good one7Jack', '2007-07-20 16:29:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3922300, 556731, 67258, '<td valign="top">I like this - the happy smile, the apparent spontaneity, the graze on the arm, the leading line of the path.</td>', 'I like this - the happy smile, the apparent spontaneity, the graze on the arm, the leading line of the path.', '2007-07-20 16:30:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3922348, 556894, 55956, '<td valign="top">this photograph is beautiful. 10! and in the favorites!! one of the fews photographs that transmit an emotion!!!!!!</td>', 'this photograph is beautiful. 10! and in the favorites!! one of the fews photographs that transmit an emotion!!!!!!', '2007-07-20 16:54:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3922422, 556981, 67258, '<td valign="top">There is something I find very appealing about this portrait, but at the same time something slightly unsettling.  The photography is very good, but I have some reservations about the processing, although I can''t quite place what it is I don''t like - perhaps it is that the eyes are too white, and the skin too smooth.  Nonetheless, a good portrait.</td>', 'There is something I find very appealing about this portrait, but at the same time something slightly unsettling.  The photography is very good, but I have some reservations about the processing, although I can''t quite place what it is I don''t like - perhaps it is that the eyes are too white, and the skin too smooth.  Nonetheless, a good portrait.', '2007-07-20 17:44:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3922441, 556555, 67258, '<td valign="top">That hair is so cute - and does give a rather wild feel!  The light is really good, especially with the shadows across the face, and I am impressed with how well you have controlled the exposure.  I do, very much, wish the child''s face had been cleaned first...</td>', 'That hair is so cute - and does give a rather wild feel!  The light is really good, especially with the shadows across the face, and I am impressed with how well you have controlled the exposure.  I do, very much, wish the child''s face had been cleaned first...', '2007-07-20 17:48:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3922460, 556891, 77196, '<td valign="top">Way too much distraction on either side. A tighter crop with just the chimney bricks &amp; model would have made a better shot. If you look at it, it almost looks like that photo was superimposed over a city shot.</td>', 'Way too much distraction on either side. A tighter crop with just the chimney bricks & model would have made a better shot. If you look at it, it almost looks like that photo was superimposed over a city shot.', '2007-07-20 17:56:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3922464, 555882, 77196, '<td valign="top">Unappealing expression. Nice even lighting on face, clothes &amp; hands. A little blown out in upper right, but does not distract too badly.</td>', 'Unappealing expression. Nice even lighting on face, clothes & hands. A little blown out in upper right, but does not distract too badly.', '2007-07-20 17:57:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3922465, 556794, 67258, '<td valign="top">A very good example of environmental portraiture. I admire everything about this, and may ''steal'' your idea for a portrait of my daughter (she won''t normally let me take her photo, but one with her beloved race bike might be on..)</td>', 'A very good example of environmental portraiture. I admire everything about this, and may ''steal'' your idea for a portrait of my daughter (she won''t normally let me take her photo, but one with her beloved race bike might be on..)', '2007-07-20 17:57:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3922467, 554353, 77196, '<td valign="top">Great shot. Love the angle, monochrome, lighting, and mood of the photo.</td>', 'Great shot. Love the angle, monochrome, lighting, and mood of the photo.', '2007-07-20 17:58:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3922473, 554072, 67258, '<td valign="top">As a viewer I almost get the feeling that I am the mirror - very strange - effective, but strange!</td>', 'As a viewer I almost get the feeling that I am the mirror - very strange - effective, but strange!', '2007-07-20 17:59:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3922482, 556730, 78303, '<td valign="top">The fingernails are actually a distraction to her beautiful facial features.  It almost looks like it is not her hand.  OTherwise, a great shot, I think.</td>', 'The fingernails are actually a distraction to her beautiful facial features.  It almost looks like it is not her hand.  OTherwise, a great shot, I think.', '2007-07-20 18:01:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3922490, 556730, 67258, '<td valign="top">Excellent pose and composition, and good use of the light - I would guess you used a reflector to keep the shadows away from the left side of her face?  I do wish her fingers and nails weren''t blurred, and the patch of light to the left is a bit distracting, although obviously outside of the challenge it can be cloned out.Good work.</td>', 'Excellent pose and composition, and good use of the light - I would guess you used a reflector to keep the shadows away from the left side of her face?  I do wish her fingers and nails weren''t blurred, and the patch of light to the left is a bit distracting, although obviously outside of the challenge it can be cloned out.Good work.', '2007-07-20 18:03:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3922493, 556628, 78303, '<td valign="top">The focus point seems wrong here.  Her near eyebrow has some strange things going on.</td>', 'The focus point seems wrong here.  Her near eyebrow has some strange things going on.', '2007-07-20 18:04:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3922496, 557041, 78303, '<td valign="top">I wish more of her left side was showing.  The right side is stunning.</td>', 'I wish more of her left side was showing.  The right side is stunning.', '2007-07-20 18:05:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3922497, 557057, 67258, '<td valign="top">The cute factor is pretty high here!  A well taken child photograph with appeal to those outside the family!</td>', 'The cute factor is pretty high here!  A well taken child photograph with appeal to those outside the family!', '2007-07-20 18:05:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3922511, 556802, 77196, '<td valign="top">The only thing that hurts this shot is the man looking over her shoulder. He directly competes for your attention and distracts from her. I''d clone out both him and the back of the head on the other side of her neck.</td>', 'The only thing that hurts this shot is the man looking over her shoulder. He directly competes for your attention and distracts from her. I''d clone out both him and the back of the head on the other side of her neck.', '2007-07-20 18:08:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3922516, 556895, 77196, '<td valign="top">Overexposed - model too light and it detracts from the photo big-time.</td>', 'Overexposed - model too light and it detracts from the photo big-time.', '2007-07-20 18:09:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3922530, 553299, 67258, '<td valign="top">This could be a lovely,incredibly beautiful,portrait, but as it is there is something about it that is just off the mark.  There appears to be a silver sheen over the model that I find rather odd, almost as though her skin and hair have been partially desaturated.  The result is that the viewers concentration centres on the model''s lips and eyes, but (for me at any rate) to the point that those are almost all I see - as though the individual is no more than her features.  Hmm, I''m not sure I have articulated my thoughts very well here - I wouln''t normally invite this, but if you want clarification, drop me a PM</td>', 'This could be a lovely,incredibly beautiful,portrait, but as it is there is something about it that is just off the mark.  There appears to be a silver sheen over the model that I find rather odd, almost as though her skin and hair have been partially desaturated.  The result is that the viewers concentration centres on the model''s lips and eyes, but (for me at any rate) to the point that those are almost all I see - as though the individual is no more than her features.  Hmm, I''m not sure I have articulated my thoughts very well here - I wouln''t normally invite this, but if you want clarification, drop me a PM', '2007-07-20 18:13:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3922531, 553900, 77196, '<td valign="top">DNMC. This is a tough shot - shooting into the sun. Upper left is blown out, right side is underexposed, so on average... No particular focal point of the picture.</td>', 'DNMC. This is a tough shot - shooting into the sun. Upper left is blown out, right side is underexposed, so on average... No particular focal point of the picture.', '2007-07-20 18:13:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3922532, 556895, 79021, '<td valign="top">The light is a little harsh</td>', 'The light is a little harsh', '2007-07-20 18:13:50.000000', NULL, 1),
