(3922561, 555505, 77196, '<td valign="top">Shooting people with glasses is difficult. In this case, there is too much reflection in the glasses of unrelated images. I''m guessing that''s the photographer in the right lens (left side as you''re looking at picture).</td>', 'Shooting people with glasses is difficult. In this case, there is too much reflection in the glasses of unrelated images. I''m guessing that''s the photographer in the right lens (left side as you''re looking at picture).', '2007-07-20 18:22:53.000000', NULL, 1),
