(3923287, 556846, 76430, '<td valign="top">It looks like a lucky grab.  I don''t know how much she likes this, but it is a cute expression.  Definitely not your standard portrait.  It''s a little washed out on the left side and it would be nice to see her mouth in the DOF.</td>', 'It looks like a lucky grab.  I don''t know how much she likes this, but it is a cute expression.  Definitely not your standard portrait.  It''s a little washed out on the left side and it would be nice to see her mouth in the DOF.', '2007-07-21 00:46:35.000000', NULL, 1),
