(3923301, 556210, 76430, '<td valign="top">Overlooking the fact for the moment that this DNMC, I''d recommend doing a landscape in landscape mode.  Maybe you are considering it''s a portrait because it''s in portrait mode.  Also, saturate the colors more to bring out the sky and forest.</td>', 'Overlooking the fact for the moment that this DNMC, I''d recommend doing a landscape in landscape mode.  Maybe you are considering it''s a portrait because it''s in portrait mode.  Also, saturate the colors more to bring out the sky and forest.', '2007-07-21 00:52:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3923311, 555762, 76430, '<td valign="top">It looks like a house cat outdoors to me.  It''s a little overexposed on top.  The branches are in the way of the face.  It''s stretching it to call it a portrait.  Still, a nice looking cat.</td>', 'It looks like a house cat outdoors to me.  It''s a little overexposed on top.  The branches are in the way of the face.  It''s stretching it to call it a portrait.  Still, a nice looking cat.', '2007-07-21 00:56:52.000000', NULL, 1),
