(3923341, 556785, 79021, '<td valign="top">I think if the sheets matched the panties, maybe white on white, it would be more of a natural look.  There is enough room in the middle of the shot, the model could be up more towards the corner so that the rest of the body was visible</td>', 'I think if the sheets matched the panties, maybe white on white, it would be more of a natural look.  There is enough room in the middle of the shot, the model could be up more towards the corner so that the rest of the body was visible', '2007-07-21 01:18:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3923347, 555830, 76430, '<td valign="top">Good picture.  Unless I''m misinterpreting you need to be a little more careful of mis-typing these short titles.  To me it reflects on the care you put into the picture and even though it isn''t the picture it often affects my scoring.  Good DOF and bokeh.  In Advanced Editing I''d recommend taking out some of the overblown white in the shirt.</td>', 'Good picture.  Unless I''m misinterpreting you need to be a little more careful of mis-typing these short titles.  To me it reflects on the care you put into the picture and even though it isn''t the picture it often affects my scoring.  Good DOF and bokeh.  In Advanced Editing I''d recommend taking out some of the overblown white in the shirt.', '2007-07-21 01:22:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3923351, 553148, 76430, '<td valign="top">Another animal portrait.  The feet are cut off and the tail appears to be a growth on the head.  The background could have been improved also and the coloring more saturated.  I''m guessing you didn''t spend a lot of time on this challenge.</td>', 'Another animal portrait.  The feet are cut off and the tail appears to be a growth on the head.  The background could have been improved also and the coloring more saturated.  I''m guessing you didn''t spend a lot of time on this challenge.', '2007-07-21 01:25:48.000000', NULL, 1),
