(3923391, 554121, 76430, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture, but hardly a portrait other than orientation and natural lighting.  Maybe you were trying to push the definition, but I fear your score will be adversely affected.  Still I''ll give you a 6 for this shot.  It would have been higher if I felt it met the challenge.  I saw a beautiful firey cloud sunset over a boat harbor a week or so ago, but alas had no camera.</td>', 'Beautiful picture, but hardly a portrait other than orientation and natural lighting.  Maybe you were trying to push the definition, but I fear your score will be adversely affected.  Still I''ll give you a 6 for this shot.  It would have been higher if I felt it met the challenge.  I saw a beautiful firey cloud sunset over a boat harbor a week or so ago, but alas had no camera.', '2007-07-21 01:53:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3923392, 555569, 81362, '<td valign="top">Beautiful girl and beautiful eyes, excellent gradation of brightness across the face, sharp where it needs to be. Perhaps the narrow light crease under her right eye is a little distracting, but I enjoy the picture very much anyway.</td>', 'Beautiful girl and beautiful eyes, excellent gradation of brightness across the face, sharp where it needs to be. Perhaps the narrow light crease under her right eye is a little distracting, but I enjoy the picture very much anyway.', '2007-07-21 01:54:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3923398, 556210, 81362, '<td valign="top">Although the light is natural, it seems flat. Consider shooting when the sun is lower in the sky and generating shadows. Taking steps to get a sharper picture and a composition with a stronger focus of interest might help.</td>', 'Although the light is natural, it seems flat. Consider shooting when the sun is lower in the sky and generating shadows. Taking steps to get a sharper picture and a composition with a stronger focus of interest might help.', '2007-07-21 02:01:28.000000', NULL, 1),
