(3923405, 557073, 76430, '<td valign="top">Nice picture.  I fear there will be some that mark you down because of the title and say it''s not natural light, but the spotlight appears to be the sun.  Nice pose and composition.  7</td>', 'Nice picture.  I fear there will be some that mark you down because of the title and say it''s not natural light, but the spotlight appears to be the sun.  Nice pose and composition.  7', '2007-07-21 02:07:40.000000', NULL, 1),
