(3923473, 553541, 76430, '<td valign="top">Nice smooth complexion.  Noise reduced?  Good background bokeh.  Very even lighting, so I''m guessing you used reflectors or did some lightening of a very defused lighting scene.  Nice coloring.  7</td>', 'Nice smooth complexion.  Noise reduced?  Good background bokeh.  Very even lighting, so I''m guessing you used reflectors or did some lightening of a very defused lighting scene.  Nice coloring.  7', '2007-07-21 02:58:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3923476, 553393, 76430, '<td valign="top">I''d recommend cropping off the top and maybe some of the left side.</td>', 'I''d recommend cropping off the top and maybe some of the left side.', '2007-07-21 03:00:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3923482, 555661, 76430, '<td valign="top">Nice soft-focus portrait.  Comtemplative expression.  The burn-out on the right works well here imho.</td>', 'Nice soft-focus portrait.  Comtemplative expression.  The burn-out on the right works well here imho.', '2007-07-21 03:02:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3923492, 556662, 16241, '<td valign="top">extreme emotion, do it again. :)</td>', 'extreme emotion, do it again. :)', '2007-07-21 03:09:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3923493, 556893, 81579, '<td valign="top">Interesting light, but I find the composition contrived (as is often the case in pictures of children).</td>', 'Interesting light, but I find the composition contrived (as is often the case in pictures of children).', '2007-07-21 03:09:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3923504, 556959, 81579, '<td valign="top">To me this is an unusually good picture of a child subject - a candid portrait, well-composed and not contrived, and without the feeling that Mommy or Daddy has coaxed the kid to look "cute". Well done!</td>', 'To me this is an unusually good picture of a child subject - a candid portrait, well-composed and not contrived, and without the feeling that Mommy or Daddy has coaxed the kid to look "cute". Well done!', '2007-07-21 03:15:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3923517, 553278, 76430, '<td valign="top">This to me does not look like innocense.  It looks like a street smart urban girl.  6</td>', 'This to me does not look like innocense.  It looks like a street smart urban girl.  6', '2007-07-21 03:20:57.000000', NULL, 1);
