(3923551, 555323, 76430, '<td valign="top">I don''t especially like the clipped head.  Otherwise very nice.</td>', 'I don''t especially like the clipped head.  Otherwise very nice.', '2007-07-21 03:40:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3923552, 556907, 79709, '<td valign="top">What a darling lil girl!</td>', 'What a darling lil girl!', '2007-07-21 03:40:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3923555, 555133, 76430, '<td valign="top">I can clearly see your arm and camera in your sunglasses.  You could have avoided that by tilting your head up some or moving the camera down.  It''s also not very sharp, probably because it looks like a small P&amp;S camera.  I''d say you rushed this entry.</td>', 'I can clearly see your arm and camera in your sunglasses.  You could have avoided that by tilting your head up some or moving the camera down.  It''s also not very sharp, probably because it looks like a small P&S camera.  I''d say you rushed this entry.', '2007-07-21 03:45:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3923557, 556857, 76430, '<td valign="top">I love the blue eyes!  It looks like it''s indoors with a bright overhead light.  Is this natural light?</td>', 'I love the blue eyes!  It looks like it''s indoors with a bright overhead light.  Is this natural light?', '2007-07-21 03:47:55.000000', NULL, 1),
