(3923642, 555328, 67258, '<td valign="top">An appealing portrait that gives the viewer a bit of an insight into the person rather than just concentrating on individual facial features.  Your subtle post processing is spot on.  Very good work.</td>', 'An appealing portrait that gives the viewer a bit of an insight into the person rather than just concentrating on individual facial features.  Your subtle post processing is spot on.  Very good work.', '2007-07-21 08:19:35.000000', NULL, 1),
