(3923647, 556323, 67258, '<td valign="top">Well exposed, with good natural skin tones. I like how natural the model appears in front of the camera; the pose, style and make-up are just right.  The one thing I would change would be the line  that cuts through the background at ear level.</td>', 'Well exposed, with good natural skin tones. I like how natural the model appears in front of the camera; the pose, style and make-up are just right.  The one thing I would change would be the line  that cuts through the background at ear level.', '2007-07-21 08:25:42.000000', NULL, 1),
