(3924100, 556528, 68546, '<td valign="top">I think the focus is on the frilly sleeves rather then the face which detracts from the portrait, and the pose looks a little awkward. The lighting is excellent though</td>', 'I think the focus is on the frilly sleeves rather then the face which detracts from the portrait, and the pose looks a little awkward. The lighting is excellent though', '2007-07-21 14:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
