(3924939, 555045, 7485, '<td valign="top">Very good use of natural light, and a great job on the makeup! Just a couple of things that I find distracting: that one leaf in front of her hair, and the hairs that seem to be caught in her eyelashes.</td>', 'Very good use of natural light, and a great job on the makeup! Just a couple of things that I find distracting: that one leaf in front of her hair, and the hairs that seem to be caught in her eyelashes.', '2007-07-22 00:57:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3925019, 555170, 73998, '<td valign="top">I think you''ve captured a decent image of a child with a look of curiosity.  However, as a portrait, I would prefer the subject to be facing the camera instead.  Also, there appears to be a yellow cast on the back of her neck reflecting from a nearby object.  Lastly, the background is too sharp and is distracting to me.</td>', 'I think you''ve captured a decent image of a child with a look of curiosity.  However, as a portrait, I would prefer the subject to be facing the camera instead.  Also, there appears to be a yellow cast on the back of her neck reflecting from a nearby object.  Lastly, the background is too sharp and is distracting to me.', '2007-07-22 01:36:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3925025, 553512, 73998, '<td valign="top">Nice sharpness but, to me, it looks way over processed.  Maybe that''s the look you wanted and there''s nothing wrong with that.  It''s just my personal taste.</td>', 'Nice sharpness but, to me, it looks way over processed.  Maybe that''s the look you wanted and there''s nothing wrong with that.  It''s just my personal taste.', '2007-07-22 01:38:33.000000', NULL, 1),
