(3925042, 555479, 73998, '<td valign="top">This is cute.  I like the DOF, composition and the use of color.  The only thing I could criticize is that her face seems little dark and flat.  Great job, though!</td>', 'This is cute.  I like the DOF, composition and the use of color.  The only thing I could criticize is that her face seems little dark and flat.  Great job, though!', '2007-07-22 01:54:36.000000', NULL, 1),
