(3925554, 556723, 63244, '<td valign="top">Although a nice photo from what I can tell, wish it were larger. You have a shadow (looks like PP) behind the couple and it is much more evident behind the guy. Coloring looks a tad off, too. All in all this is not a bad photograph, but it might help to try reworking this just a touch. Your lighting and your model pose is very nice. (Maybe have him move his left arm down?) Keep it up.  There is definitely potential in your work!!</td>', 'Although a nice photo from what I can tell, wish it were larger. You have a shadow (looks like PP) behind the couple and it is much more evident behind the guy. Coloring looks a tad off, too. All in all this is not a bad photograph, but it might help to try reworking this just a touch. Your lighting and your model pose is very nice. (Maybe have him move his left arm down?) Keep it up.  There is definitely potential in your work!!', '2007-07-22 11:34:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3925560, 556012, 63244, '<td valign="top">Love the sepia tone. This is a very nice portrait. There is just enough detail in the shadows to see the catch light in the eyes. Textures, everywhere. Love it! And yet, very classic - simple. Your detail is wonderful and a very nice bokeh as well!  Great job.</td>', 'Love the sepia tone. This is a very nice portrait. There is just enough detail in the shadows to see the catch light in the eyes. Textures, everywhere. Love it! And yet, very classic - simple. Your detail is wonderful and a very nice bokeh as well!  Great job.', '2007-07-22 11:38:03.000000', NULL, 1),
