(3925823, 556627, 66310, '<td valign="top">Very pretty. You did a good job in showing us her feminenity!</td>', 'Very pretty. You did a good job in showing us her feminenity!', '2007-07-22 14:04:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3925825, 555182, 66310, '<td valign="top">very nice!</td>', 'very nice!', '2007-07-22 14:05:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3925830, 556981, 66310, '<td valign="top">I think a reflector or a bit of repositioning to light him up more would have really defined him from the background</td>', 'I think a reflector or a bit of repositioning to light him up more would have really defined him from the background', '2007-07-22 14:08:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3925833, 554521, 66310, '<td valign="top">Very creative......7</td>', 'Very creative......7', '2007-07-22 14:09:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3925834, 556949, 66310, '<td valign="top">nice colors!</td>', 'nice colors!', '2007-07-22 14:09:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3925844, 555837, 81299, '<td valign="top">Great use of light, love the use of thirds as well. The flower and plant stem leading the eye up to the top third of the image and to the focus of the image. Great use of depth of field as well, keeps a person looking at the focus point of the image...</td>', 'Great use of light, love the use of thirds as well. The flower and plant stem leading the eye up to the top third of the image and to the focus of the image. Great use of depth of field as well, keeps a person looking at the focus point of the image...', '2007-07-22 14:11:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3925848, 555569, 66310, '<td valign="top">so gorgeous......just beautiful!!.....8</td>', 'so gorgeous......just beautiful!!.....8', '2007-07-22 14:12:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3925865, 554183, 77213, '<td valign="top">Really nice use of light, the highlights/ shadows are perfect, nice amount of sharpness too.  Great.  I gave this a 9.</td>', 'Really nice use of light, the highlights/ shadows are perfect, nice amount of sharpness too.  Great.  I gave this a 9.', '2007-07-22 14:19:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3925867, 556891, 77213, '<td valign="top">I love how the chimney stack is used - great composition.  I gave it a 9. Great!</td>', 'I love how the chimney stack is used - great composition.  I gave it a 9. Great!', '2007-07-22 14:20:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3925872, 555871, 77213, '<td valign="top">Nice  - great subject, great use of black and white -9.</td>', 'Nice  - great subject, great use of black and white -9.', '2007-07-22 14:20:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3925873, 555521, 77213, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 10, because in thinking about the pictures later, this is the only one that I really remembered, that kind of "haunted" me.  It''s because you''ve captured something universal - and if not universal, then at least something American.  It doesn''t matter who these boys really are, the photo has an "every boy" feeling.  I like the sepia tone - the only thing I coulod say negatively is that it''s not as sharp as I would have liked.  Really great job.</td>', 'I gave this a 10, because in thinking about the pictures later, this is the only one that I really remembered, that kind of "haunted" me.  It''s because you''ve captured something universal - and if not universal, then at least something American.  It doesn''t matter who these boys really are, the photo has an "every boy" feeling.  I like the sepia tone - the only thing I coulod say negatively is that it''s not as sharp as I would have liked.  Really great job.', '2007-07-22 14:20:59.000000', NULL, 1);
