(3926547, 554183, 66348, '<td valign="top">Very nicely shot and edited. Lighting is great for being natural. Love the clarity and sharpness and the expression on his face. Very Joey L. like. Nice work.</td>', 'Very nicely shot and edited. Lighting is great for being natural. Love the clarity and sharpness and the expression on his face. Very Joey L. like. Nice work.', '2007-07-22 20:33:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3926561, 556890, 66348, '<td valign="top">Very nice B&amp;W conversion, composition is also very nice. Sharpness seems to be a bit more on the scarf, but still a great shot. Nice work.</td>', 'Very nice B&W conversion, composition is also very nice. Sharpness seems to be a bit more on the scarf, but still a great shot. Nice work.', '2007-07-22 20:36:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3926563, 555569, 64446, '<td valign="top">What a beutiful image! That''s a winner!</td>', 'What a beutiful image! That''s a winner!', '2007-07-22 20:37:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3926566, 555882, 66348, '<td valign="top">Great capture, and candid shot. Love the composition and use of selective desaturation.</td>', 'Great capture, and candid shot. Love the composition and use of selective desaturation.', '2007-07-22 20:38:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3926583, 556012, 66348, '<td valign="top">Great capture. Love the DOF and clarity and sharpness on the face. Great composition and sepia tone.</td>', 'Great capture. Love the DOF and clarity and sharpness on the face. Great composition and sepia tone.', '2007-07-22 20:45:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3926584, 556074, 66348, '<td valign="top">Great capture. Love the B&amp;W composition, and sharpness on the face. Love the expression. Nice work.</td>', 'Great capture. Love the B&W composition, and sharpness on the face. Love the expression. Nice work.', '2007-07-22 20:46:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3926590, 555599, 66348, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture, love the lighting and B&amp;W conversion. Composition is right on and congrats on the beautiful baby.</td>', 'Beautiful capture, love the lighting and B&W conversion. Composition is right on and congrats on the beautiful baby.', '2007-07-22 20:48:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3926594, 557073, 66348, '<td valign="top">Love the lighting. I think you picked the perfect spot. The lighting is wonderful, I love the B&amp;W conversion with the tone, and the composition is right on. I also love the border and would love to know how you did it. Very nice work. 10</td>', 'Love the lighting. I think you picked the perfect spot. The lighting is wonderful, I love the B&W conversion with the tone, and the composition is right on. I also love the border and would love to know how you did it. Very nice work. 10', '2007-07-22 20:50:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3926601, 555852, 66348, '<td valign="top">Very nice lighting, great composition and very sharp and clear. Nice work. 9</td>', 'Very nice lighting, great composition and very sharp and clear. Nice work. 9', '2007-07-22 20:54:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3926604, 557041, 66348, '<td valign="top">Very nice angle, great clarity and sharpness on the face. Nice expression. Love the composition and shot. Nice work.</td>', 'Very nice angle, great clarity and sharpness on the face. Nice expression. Love the composition and shot. Nice work.', '2007-07-22 20:55:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3926608, 556794, 66348, '<td valign="top">Great sharpness and clarity. Love the composition and the slight vignetting around the shot. Nice work.</td>', 'Great sharpness and clarity. Love the composition and the slight vignetting around the shot. Nice work.', '2007-07-22 20:58:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3926610, 556895, 66348, '<td valign="top">Nice angle, and good composition on the shot. Her expression looks more of pain then in loving a color though. Nice work.</td>', 'Nice angle, and good composition on the shot. Her expression looks more of pain then in loving a color though. Nice work.', '2007-07-22 20:59:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3926612, 556892, 66348, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and sharpness and clarity on the face. Love the DOF and expression on her face. Nice work.</td>', 'Nice composition and sharpness and clarity on the face. Love the DOF and expression on her face. Nice work.', '2007-07-22 21:00:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3926617, 555045, 66348, '<td valign="top">Incredible shot. Love the clarity on her face and the expression. The eye shadow contrasting the leaves or ivy puts everything together, and the composition is just perfect. DOF right on the money. Awesome work. 10</td>', 'Incredible shot. Love the clarity on her face and the expression. The eye shadow contrasting the leaves or ivy puts everything together, and the composition is just perfect. DOF right on the money. Awesome work. 10', '2007-07-22 21:03:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3926618, 557072, 66348, '<td valign="top">Great expression and use of DOF. Nice sharpness on her face. The lighting works very well with her blonde hair and bright blue eyes. Nice work.</td>', 'Great expression and use of DOF. Nice sharpness on her face. The lighting works very well with her blonde hair and bright blue eyes. Nice work.', '2007-07-22 21:03:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3926622, 556627, 66348, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition and lighting on the face. Sharpness and clarity are right on. Great angle and nice expression. Good work.</td>', 'Very nice composition and lighting on the face. Sharpness and clarity are right on. Great angle and nice expression. Good work.', '2007-07-22 21:04:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3926623, 554309, 66348, '<td valign="top">I think the lighting is right on, and the angle is a great idea, but I think you may take a hit because of the sharpness not being all there on the face. Great pose and expression non the less.</td>', 'I think the lighting is right on, and the angle is a great idea, but I think you may take a hit because of the sharpness not being all there on the face. Great pose and expression non the less.', '2007-07-22 21:05:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3926625, 554532, 66348, '<td valign="top">Really great shot. Love the composition and expression on his face. The sepia tone really works on the B&amp;W conversion. Sharpness is also right on. Nice work.</td>', 'Really great shot. Love the composition and expression on his face. The sepia tone really works on the B&W conversion. Sharpness is also right on. Nice work.', '2007-07-22 21:07:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3926628, 555837, 66348, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition and the angle you chose to use in the challenge. The light reflecting of the hat adds just enough light on the left side of her face. The expression is great, IMO a different flower would have made me believe that she was going in for the smell. Great shot non the less. 8</td>', 'I really like the composition and the angle you chose to use in the challenge. The light reflecting of the hat adds just enough light on the left side of her face. The expression is great, IMO a different flower would have made me believe that she was going in for the smell. Great shot non the less. 8', '2007-07-22 21:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3926646, 556622, 66348, '<td valign="top">Very nice B&amp;W conversion. Great lighting. Sharpness and clarity are right on. Nice work.</td>', 'Very nice B&W conversion. Great lighting. Sharpness and clarity are right on. Nice work.', '2007-07-22 21:18:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3926655, 553786, 66348, '<td valign="top">Looks like a mud fight, or another one of Larus''s experiments with mud. Great composition though, I like the different perspective of not having the entire face in the shot. Sharpness and clarity are right on, and expression is priceless. Nice work.</td>', 'Looks like a mud fight, or another one of Larus''s experiments with mud. Great composition though, I like the different perspective of not having the entire face in the shot. Sharpness and clarity are right on, and expression is priceless. Nice work.', '2007-07-22 21:22:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3926659, 555955, 66348, '<td valign="top">Great DOF and sharpness and clarity are right perfect on her face. Great expression, and love the composition. Very Librodo feel to it. Nice work.</td>', 'Great DOF and sharpness and clarity are right perfect on her face. Great expression, and love the composition. Very Librodo feel to it. Nice work.', '2007-07-22 21:24:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3926663, 554587, 66348, '<td valign="top">Great composition and DOF. Lighting is great and sharpness &amp; clarity are right on. Great expression. Nice work.</td>', 'Great composition and DOF. Lighting is great and sharpness & clarity are right on. Great expression. Nice work.', '2007-07-22 21:28:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3926666, 556219, 66348, '<td valign="top">Great composition and colors. Really like the desat here and yet the colors really come out at you. Nice work.</td>', 'Great composition and colors. Really like the desat here and yet the colors really come out at you. Nice work.', '2007-07-22 21:30:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3926667, 556800, 66348, '<td valign="top">Great angle, love the lighting and expression on her face. Great clarity and sharpness on her face. Nice work.</td>', 'Great angle, love the lighting and expression on her face. Great clarity and sharpness on her face. Nice work.', '2007-07-22 21:31:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3926668, 556962, 66348, '<td valign="top">Great DOF, love the expression and the composition. Colors look great and just the right amount of saturation. Nice work.</td>', 'Great DOF, love the expression and the composition. Colors look great and just the right amount of saturation. Nice work.', '2007-07-22 21:31:52.000000', NULL, 1),
