(3928454, 556733, 68546, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture, great clarity in the eyes and you''ve captured the character really well. My only small criticism is that the hand side on like that looks very big next to the face and so distracts from the portrait very slightly. A small complaint on a great portrait though</td>', 'Excellent capture, great clarity in the eyes and you''ve captured the character really well. My only small criticism is that the hand side on like that looks very big next to the face and so distracts from the portrait very slightly. A small complaint on a great portrait though', '2007-07-23 12:02:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3928459, 555569, 68546, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition and expression. The soft colours surrounding the bright eyes really draw you into the shot. The only thing I can fault is I''m not sure the eyes were in critical focus, the nose and the hair at the top left seem to be the sharpest points. A great portrait anyway</td>', 'Excellent composition and expression. The soft colours surrounding the bright eyes really draw you into the shot. The only thing I can fault is I''m not sure the eyes were in critical focus, the nose and the hair at the top left seem to be the sharpest points. A great portrait anyway', '2007-07-23 12:05:47.000000', NULL, 1),
