(3929615, 555182, 67258, '<td valign="top">A nice photograph for your album, but little tyo hold the attention of strangers who don''t havethe same emotional tie.</td>', 'A nice photograph for your album, but little tyo hold the attention of strangers who don''t havethe same emotional tie.', '2007-07-23 19:22:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3929616, 555222, 67258, '<td valign="top">A reasonable entry, but you need to work on your post-processing sharpening.</td>', 'A reasonable entry, but you need to work on your post-processing sharpening.', '2007-07-23 19:22:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3929617, 556345, 67258, '<td valign="top">A pleasing portrait let down by heavy use of post-processing.  The Gaussian blur isn''t convincing - bits that should be in focus, that would have been on the same plane as the face, aren''t.  Go back to your original, treat it with a very gentle hand, and I am convinced you will have a portrait you and your model will wish to keep for posterity.</td>', 'A pleasing portrait let down by heavy use of post-processing.  The Gaussian blur isn''t convincing - bits that should be in focus, that would have been on the same plane as the face, aren''t.  Go back to your original, treat it with a very gentle hand, and I am convinced you will have a portrait you and your model will wish to keep for posterity.', '2007-07-23 19:22:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3929620, 553288, 60984, '<td valign="top">Poor quality and I''m sorry that I don''t get the setup of this picture</td>', 'Poor quality and I''m sorry that I don''t get the setup of this picture', '2007-07-23 19:22:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3929621, 553221, 67258, '<td valign="top">The white t-shirt masks the smoke, which rather defeats the purpose of the composition!</td>', 'The white t-shirt masks the smoke, which rather defeats the purpose of the composition!', '2007-07-23 19:22:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3929624, 556346, 67258, '<td valign="top">You have a sweet model - try photographing him in the evening light,I thin you will be impressed with how much it will improve your portraits of him.</td>', 'You have a sweet model - try photographing him in the evening light,I thin you will be impressed with how much it will improve your portraits of him.', '2007-07-23 19:22:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3929628, 557062, 60984, '<td valign="top">Dressing up a toddler like this. I hope it is a girl. I don''t see anything special in this photo.</td>', 'Dressing up a toddler like this. I hope it is a girl. I don''t see anything special in this photo.', '2007-07-23 19:23:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3929629, 556383, 67258, '<td valign="top">This has a snapshot feel to it, rather than a considered portrait. The background is somewhat distracting - next time take time to scan your eyes around the viewfinder to make sure that you only have those elements that you intend to include.  I suspect that this is a bonny little girl, and she appears to have heaps of character, but you have caught her in an unflattering pose.</td>', 'This has a snapshot feel to it, rather than a considered portrait. The background is somewhat distracting - next time take time to scan your eyes around the viewfinder to make sure that you only have those elements that you intend to include.  I suspect that this is a bonny little girl, and she appears to have heaps of character, but you have caught her in an unflattering pose.', '2007-07-23 19:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3929630, 556242, 67258, '<td valign="top">A fun shot, but more as a holiday memento than as a portrait.</td>', 'A fun shot, but more as a holiday memento than as a portrait.', '2007-07-23 19:24:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3929631, 554865, 60984, '<td valign="top">Well done. Excellent combination of object and color filter.</td>', 'Well done. Excellent combination of object and color filter.', '2007-07-23 19:24:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3929638, 556755, 67258, '<td valign="top">I am not keen on the effect that this has produced - shame, as there is a gorgeous portrait in there.</td>', 'I am not keen on the effect that this has produced - shame, as there is a gorgeous portrait in there.', '2007-07-23 19:25:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3929640, 556628, 60984, '<td valign="top">Too light underneath the chin. Too much light in the hair. Overall poor quality.</td>', 'Too light underneath the chin. Too much light in the hair. Overall poor quality.', '2007-07-23 19:25:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3929643, 555181, 67258, '<td valign="top">Perhaps not what I would expect to see if I went to an exhibition of portraits! As far as the photo goes, the colour combination of red and green is good, and the diagonal nature of the composition works.  The focus is slightly soft - a very slightly deeper depth of field might have helped.  I find the black and red stripiness of the background slightly off-putting.</td>', 'Perhaps not what I would expect to see if I went to an exhibition of portraits! As far as the photo goes, the colour combination of red and green is good, and the diagonal nature of the composition works.  The focus is slightly soft - a very slightly deeper depth of field might have helped.  I find the black and red stripiness of the background slightly off-putting.', '2007-07-23 19:26:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3929645, 553066, 67258, '<td valign="top">A sweet looking child, it is a shame his eyes aren''t a little more visible.  Watch out for unwanted elements (in this case the post) creeping in to the frame and distracting the viewer.</td>', 'A sweet looking child, it is a shame his eyes aren''t a little more visible.  Watch out for unwanted elements (in this case the post) creeping in to the frame and distracting the viewer.', '2007-07-23 19:26:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3929646, 556257, 67258, '<td valign="top">You have the basis of a super portrait here, but I suspectthat you got the exposure wrong in-camera.  The tell tale processing signs, in particular the halo, are too visible.</td>', 'You have the basis of a super portrait here, but I suspectthat you got the exposure wrong in-camera.  The tell tale processing signs, in particular the halo, are too visible.', '2007-07-23 19:26:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3929648, 556222, 67258, '<td valign="top">i am not keen on this photo - the slotted blind behind you does little to compliment the portrait, and your pose looks rather uncomfortable, as thoug you didn''t really want to be being photgraphed.</td>', 'i am not keen on this photo - the slotted blind behind you does little to compliment the portrait, and your pose looks rather uncomfortable, as thoug you didn''t really want to be being photgraphed.', '2007-07-23 19:26:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3929651, 556540, 67258, '<td valign="top">From the title I guess that you were trying to recreate the feel of a vintage photo.  In terms of that aim this photo doesn''t work for me - the colour caste is more pinkish than sepia and the clear modernity of the model doesn''t match the style.  As a portrait in terms of this challenge it has both pluses ad minuses: other than what I have already said, the soft focus on the face combined with the sharp focus on the ear-rings seems wrong, however I do like the composition,and also the stare of the model.</td>', 'From the title I guess that you were trying to recreate the feel of a vintage photo.  In terms of that aim this photo doesn''t work for me - the colour caste is more pinkish than sepia and the clear modernity of the model doesn''t match the style.  As a portrait in terms of this challenge it has both pluses ad minuses: other than what I have already said, the soft focus on the face combined with the sharp focus on the ear-rings seems wrong, however I do like the composition,and also the stare of the model.', '2007-07-23 19:27:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3929652, 555475, 67258, '<td valign="top">A happy smile, but a shame there isn''t some eye contact with the viewer.  I like the out of focus street cafe, adding some context to the shot.</td>', 'A happy smile, but a shame there isn''t some eye contact with the viewer.  I like the out of focus street cafe, adding some context to the shot.', '2007-07-23 19:27:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3929654, 556653, 67258, '<td valign="top">The light was not playing to your advantage here.  The photo is fine as a record shot, but lacking something as a portrait.</td>', 'The light was not playing to your advantage here.  The photo is fine as a record shot, but lacking something as a portrait.', '2007-07-23 19:27:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3929655, 555183, 67258, '<td valign="top">This makes for an interesting portrait, but would benefit from some further post-processing work.  The tonal range is on the flat side, with little in the way of true blacks.  Your Dad looks pretty amazing for 94, even in a hospital bed!</td>', 'This makes for an interesting portrait, but would benefit from some further post-processing work.  The tonal range is on the flat side, with little in the way of true blacks.  Your Dad looks pretty amazing for 94, even in a hospital bed!', '2007-07-23 19:27:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3929656, 553299, 60984, '<td valign="top">In my opinion this photograph misses too much color.</td>', 'In my opinion this photograph misses too much color.', '2007-07-23 19:27:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3929660, 556827, 67258, '<td valign="top">Not the best of light for a portrait, and I do find the background rather distracting.  That said, you have produced a portrait that is interesting and has some narrative to it.</td>', 'Not the best of light for a portrait, and I do find the background rather distracting.  That said, you have produced a portrait that is interesting and has some narrative to it.', '2007-07-23 19:28:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3929664, 557050, 67258, '<td valign="top">I rarely find photographs of babies eating attractive, but that aside, the frame filling composition is effective.</td>', 'I rarely find photographs of babies eating attractive, but that aside, the frame filling composition is effective.', '2007-07-23 19:28:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3929665, 556965, 67258, '<td valign="top">The sharpest focus point is just beyond the baby''s face, which is a shame;there also seems to be a slight colour caste thrown by the brim of the yellow hat.  Nonetheless, a nice composition and a very sweet model!</td>', 'The sharpest focus point is just beyond the baby''s face, which is a shame;there also seems to be a slight colour caste thrown by the brim of the yellow hat.  Nonetheless, a nice composition and a very sweet model!', '2007-07-23 19:28:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3929667, 556728, 67258, '<td valign="top">I feel that this type of shot really needs a little more expression in the models face - hapiness/fun/laughter etc to pull it off effectively.  The contrast against the clear blue sky is good.</td>', 'I feel that this type of shot really needs a little more expression in the models face - hapiness/fun/laughter etc to pull it off effectively.  The contrast against the clear blue sky is good.', '2007-07-23 19:29:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3929668, 554309, 60984, '<td valign="top">Nice idea with the stairs/escalators in the back, but in my opinion the head (in color) doesn''t match the overall black and white of the rest of the photo.</td>', 'Nice idea with the stairs/escalators in the back, but in my opinion the head (in color) doesn''t match the overall black and white of the rest of the photo.', '2007-07-23 19:29:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3929672, 556901, 67258, '<td valign="top">She isn''t, is she!  I suspect that you ran this through a fairly heavy dose of noise reduction software - there a few tell tale signs where the texture is too smooth, notably the girl''s hair and her t-shirt.  A shallower depth of field would have thrown the background out of focus even more - next time watch out for distractions such as the wall running through the girl''s head.  I sound very negative - it''s not bad, just not quite there.</td>', 'She isn''t, is she!  I suspect that you ran this through a fairly heavy dose of noise reduction software - there a few tell tale signs where the texture is too smooth, notably the girl''s hair and her t-shirt.  A shallower depth of field would have thrown the background out of focus even more - next time watch out for distractions such as the wall running through the girl''s head.  I sound very negative - it''s not bad, just not quite there.', '2007-07-23 19:30:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3929673, 556906, 67258, '<td valign="top">A prettily composed portrait - the flowers in the hair provide a nice romantic touch.  I am not keen on the post-processing, and in particular the orange shadows, which give a harsh look at odds with the romantic style pose.</td>', 'A prettily composed portrait - the flowers in the hair provide a nice romantic touch.  I am not keen on the post-processing, and in particular the orange shadows, which give a harsh look at odds with the romantic style pose.', '2007-07-23 19:30:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3929674, 555770, 60984, '<td valign="top">The tears don''t match the eyes, so i doubt the realty of tears. Furthermore it is not sharp.</td>', 'The tears don''t match the eyes, so i doubt the realty of tears. Furthermore it is not sharp.', '2007-07-23 19:30:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3929678, 556807, 67258, '<td valign="top">they look like they were having fun! A nice reminder of the day, but judging it purely froma photographic perspective, I am not sure the two models compliment each other - you might have been better sticking with one or the other, rather than the two together.</td>', 'they look like they were having fun! A nice reminder of the day, but judging it purely froma photographic perspective, I am not sure the two models compliment each other - you might have been better sticking with one or the other, rather than the two together.', '2007-07-23 19:32:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3929680, 555043, 67258, '<td valign="top">You have a sweet model, but this photo would be so much nicer if she didn''t have that paper(?)in her mouth!</td>', 'You have a sweet model, but this photo would be so much nicer if she didn''t have that paper(?)in her mouth!', '2007-07-23 19:32:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3929682, 555698, 60984, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, but I don''t like the distortion of the edges.</td>', 'Nice shot, but I don''t like the distortion of the edges.', '2007-07-23 19:32:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3929685, 556843, 67258, '<td valign="top">I would guess that you have upped the colour temperature in a RAW conversion (although I may be completely off the mark).  Any way, I am not entirely convinced by the colour of this - it seems just too orange, rather than giving a pleasing sun-kissed look.  The inclusion of the headphones seems somewhat out of place.</td>', 'I would guess that you have upped the colour temperature in a RAW conversion (although I may be completely off the mark).  Any way, I am not entirely convinced by the colour of this - it seems just too orange, rather than giving a pleasing sun-kissed look.  The inclusion of the headphones seems somewhat out of place.', '2007-07-23 19:32:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3929688, 556742, 67258, '<td valign="top">It is a bit of a shame that the little boy isn''t grinning, as a smile would compliment the one eye closed look better than the serious face, I feel.  Did you play around with other crop ideas?  I would be tempted to crop the bottom section, to just above the writing on the t-shirt, off, so that the viewers attention is concentrated on the face.  You have a cute model here!</td>', 'It is a bit of a shame that the little boy isn''t grinning, as a smile would compliment the one eye closed look better than the serious face, I feel.  Did you play around with other crop ideas?  I would be tempted to crop the bottom section, to just above the writing on the t-shirt, off, so that the viewers attention is concentrated on the face.  You have a cute model here!', '2007-07-23 19:32:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3929689, 557048, 67258, '<td valign="top">I am not particularly keen on the vignetting; it might suit a more formal portrait, but to me, not this particular shot.  You clearly have skill with the camera - your focus is sharp, and importantly, the exposure is good, but this photograph doesn''t really work for me.  A head and shoulders formal portrait works, but in this candid I feel there needs to be more in order to set the context.</td>', 'I am not particularly keen on the vignetting; it might suit a more formal portrait, but to me, not this particular shot.  You clearly have skill with the camera - your focus is sharp, and importantly, the exposure is good, but this photograph doesn''t really work for me.  A head and shoulders formal portrait works, but in this candid I feel there needs to be more in order to set the context.', '2007-07-23 19:32:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3929691, 556861, 67258, '<td valign="top">The light is very harsh,and the bright patch on the riders face is distracting.    I am glad that you didn''t focus in too closely, as the background plays an important part in the composition.</td>', 'The light is very harsh,and the bright patch on the riders face is distracting.    I am glad that you didn''t focus in too closely, as the background plays an important part in the composition.', '2007-07-23 19:33:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3929692, 556838, 67258, '<td valign="top">Very sweet!</td>', 'Very sweet!', '2007-07-23 19:33:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3929700, 556275, 60984, '<td valign="top">In my opinion this object does not really fit the challenge.</td>', 'In my opinion this object does not really fit the challenge.', '2007-07-23 19:34:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3929701, 556810, 67258, '<td valign="top">I find the sunglasses rather off-putting, as though I can''t see past them, and can get no feel for the person behind the mask.</td>', 'I find the sunglasses rather off-putting, as though I can''t see past them, and can get no feel for the person behind the mask.', '2007-07-23 19:34:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3929702, 556911, 67258, '<td valign="top">A self-portrait takien whilst holding the camera?  If it is, youhave made a reasonable fist of it, if not, you need to spend a bit more time considering the composition.  Either way, as a stand alone photograph, there are some problems - in particular, the enlarged forearm, which is just too close to the camera.  That said, you have obviously takentime to consider the light, the background and the pose, which is good.</td>', 'A self-portrait takien whilst holding the camera?  If it is, youhave made a reasonable fist of it, if not, you need to spend a bit more time considering the composition.  Either way, as a stand alone photograph, there are some problems - in particular, the enlarged forearm, which is just too close to the camera.  That said, you have obviously takentime to consider the light, the background and the pose, which is good.', '2007-07-23 19:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3929705, 556339, 67258, '<td valign="top">I am unsure of what the intent was here.  Is the model showing shock, horror, laughter?  I find it hard to tell.  On a technical note, the focus appears rather on the soft side.</td>', 'I am unsure of what the intent was here.  Is the model showing shock, horror, laughter?  I find it hard to tell.  On a technical note, the focus appears rather on the soft side.', '2007-07-23 19:34:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3929706, 553786, 60984, '<td valign="top">Great expression of the eyes.</td>', 'Great expression of the eyes.', '2007-07-23 19:35:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3929707, 553894, 67258, '<td valign="top">A very sweet smile.  Lipstick seems rather inappropriate for a young girl, and jars with me.  The skin tones do not look completely natural - a little too pink, perhaps..</td>', 'A very sweet smile.  Lipstick seems rather inappropriate for a young girl, and jars with me.  The skin tones do not look completely natural - a little too pink, perhaps..', '2007-07-23 19:35:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3929710, 553071, 60984, '<td valign="top">I don''t see the portrait aspect.</td>', 'I don''t see the portrait aspect.', '2007-07-23 19:35:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3929712, 556905, 67258, '<td valign="top">This is a style of processing that I tend to rather dislike - it seems to me that the subject of the portrait becomes little more than the eyes, at the expense of the overall feel for the person as a whole.</td>', 'This is a style of processing that I tend to rather dislike - it seems to me that the subject of the portrait becomes little more than the eyes, at the expense of the overall feel for the person as a whole.', '2007-07-23 19:36:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3929714, 556257, 60984, '<td valign="top">I simply like portraits of aged faces... Only the face tells lots of stories.</td>', 'I simply like portraits of aged faces... Only the face tells lots of stories.', '2007-07-23 19:37:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3929715, 556857, 67258, '<td valign="top">This could have been stunning, but, for me at least, there are a couple of issues that totally change the feel.  <br/> <br/>First what I like - the composition is good, the spare nature compliments the sad face.  The perspective is an excellent choice, and really helps the viewer feel the eye contact; it also adds to the feeling of the child''s vulnerability.   The child''s expression connects with me.<br/> <br/>Here is why I am not keen on the photo as entered here - firstly the processing of the eyes, which become a too dominant feature.  The processing here just doesn''t meld with the overall photo. Secondly the bright overblown section of hair, and thirdly the change of background.  These last two are easily dealt with by cropping just below the line in the background.<br/> <br/>I sound very negative - other''s may like the portrait as it is, but I personally would love to see it processed differently, more subtlely, as I feel that it is a strong base photograph</td>', 'This could have been stunning, but, for me at least, there are a couple of issues that totally change the feel.   First what I like - the composition is good, the spare nature compliments the sad face.  The perspective is an excellent choice, and really helps the viewer feel the eye contact; it also adds to the feeling of the child''s vulnerability.   The child''s expression connects with me. Here is why I am not keen on the photo as entered here - firstly the processing of the eyes, which become a too dominant feature.  The processing here just doesn''t meld with the overall photo. Secondly the bright overblown section of hair, and thirdly the change of background.  These last two are easily dealt with by cropping just below the line in the background. I sound very negative - other''s may like the portrait as it is, but I personally would love to see it processed differently, more subtlely, as I feel that it is a strong base photograph', '2007-07-23 19:37:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3929717, 556507, 60984, '<td valign="top">Well, poor quality and I don''t see the challenge in this.</td>', 'Well, poor quality and I don''t see the challenge in this.', '2007-07-23 19:38:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3929718, 555964, 67258, '<td valign="top">The colour combination works very well,as does the composition.</td>', 'The colour combination works very well,as does the composition.', '2007-07-23 19:38:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3929722, 555479, 60984, '<td valign="top">At first sight a 13 in a dozen photo. Looking again makes the subject stand out from the rest of the photo.</td>', 'At first sight a 13 in a dozen photo. Looking again makes the subject stand out from the rest of the photo.', '2007-07-23 19:39:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3929724, 554787, 60984, '<td valign="top">Well done playing with the light</td>', 'Well done playing with the light', '2007-07-23 19:40:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3929727, 556857, 60984, '<td valign="top">The eyes make the photo</td>', 'The eyes make the photo', '2007-07-23 19:41:46.000000', NULL, 1),
