(3931556, 554521, 71608, '<td valign="top">Beautiful,</td>', 'Beautiful,', '2007-07-24 10:06:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3931559, 556074, 71608, '<td valign="top">Cool stuff, though would love it if his eyes were a bit more of a feature :)</td>', 'Cool stuff, though would love it if his eyes were a bit more of a feature :)', '2007-07-24 10:08:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3931592, 556893, 24613, '<td valign="top">Very nice! :) 10</td>', 'Very nice! :) 10', '2007-07-24 10:25:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3931633, 556898, 52713, '<td valign="top">Very well done. Love the feel of this one.</td>', 'Very well done. Love the feel of this one.', '2007-07-24 10:42:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3931635, 554784, 52713, '<td valign="top">nice moment.</td>', 'nice moment.', '2007-07-24 10:42:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3931636, 556283, 52713, '<td valign="top">great smile, nice capture</td>', 'great smile, nice capture', '2007-07-24 10:43:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3931645, 556898, 68256, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting, model, composition and pose....10</td>', 'Beautiful lighting, model, composition and pose....10', '2007-07-24 10:49:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3931648, 555248, 68256, '<td valign="top">This is outstanding B/W...the contrast and tone are just wonderful.  I hope you''re getting fair votes and not crazy stuff like "not a portrait, a candid" blah blah blah....This photo is a no brainer 10.</td>', 'This is outstanding B/W...the contrast and tone are just wonderful.  I hope you''re getting fair votes and not crazy stuff like "not a portrait, a candid" blah blah blah....This photo is a no brainer 10.', '2007-07-24 10:51:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3931649, 557073, 68256, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting and composition.  I love your post processing too.  Perfect 10.</td>', 'Beautiful lighting and composition.  I love your post processing too.  Perfect 10.', '2007-07-24 10:51:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3931653, 556462, 68256, '<td valign="top">Very genuine model and pose, I love it.  It is so nice to see this...10</td>', 'Very genuine model and pose, I love it.  It is so nice to see this...10', '2007-07-24 10:53:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3931654, 556947, 68256, '<td valign="top">Going back and forth between a 9 and 10....if it wasn''t for those durn blown bokeh higlights I would definately give it a 10...Never mind, the portrait is worth a 10.    Perfect diffused light and the tones are absolutely beautiful.</td>', 'Going back and forth between a 9 and 10....if it wasn''t for those durn blown bokeh higlights I would definately give it a 10...Never mind, the portrait is worth a 10.    Perfect diffused light and the tones are absolutely beautiful.', '2007-07-24 10:53:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3931661, 556960, 68256, '<td valign="top">The broad lighting really supports this subject.  The hat is perfectly placed to provide a frame for his face....great control of the situation.  I can''t think of anything that would have made it better....10</td>', 'The broad lighting really supports this subject.  The hat is perfectly placed to provide a frame for his face....great control of the situation.  I can''t think of anything that would have made it better....10', '2007-07-24 10:56:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3931681, 556745, 81706, '<td valign="top">Love the look of under water!</td>', 'Love the look of under water!', '2007-07-24 11:07:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3931684, 556858, 81706, '<td valign="top">Perfect setting!</td>', 'Perfect setting!', '2007-07-24 11:08:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3931687, 554532, 81706, '<td valign="top">Amazing shot!</td>', 'Amazing shot!', '2007-07-24 11:09:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3931807, 556464, 64035, '<td valign="top">I really like the contrast between the subject''s skin and the straw. There are a couple of technical issues (the blown highlights, the over-shadowed eyes), but overall I think this is an excellent photo.</td>', 'I really like the contrast between the subject''s skin and the straw. There are a couple of technical issues (the blown highlights, the over-shadowed eyes), but overall I think this is an excellent photo.', '2007-07-24 12:16:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3931810, 553238, 64035, '<td valign="top">Great pose, and good line about the whole thing (the right-angle that the gun and the hair create is particularly good). Well lit and well composed.</td>', 'Great pose, and good line about the whole thing (the right-angle that the gun and the hair create is particularly good). Well lit and well composed.', '2007-07-24 12:17:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3931811, 555248, 64035, '<td valign="top">Totally different to almost everything else in the challenge. A great portrait, for me, with fabulous lines leading towards the subject. Really good light, and excellent post-capture work.</td>', 'Totally different to almost everything else in the challenge. A great portrait, for me, with fabulous lines leading towards the subject. Really good light, and excellent post-capture work.', '2007-07-24 12:18:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3931813, 555089, 64035, '<td valign="top">I love the way her pose echoes the archway. I also love the sharpness, the texture of the skirt, door and arch, and the sense of motion. One of my favourites in this challenge.</td>', 'I love the way her pose echoes the archway. I also love the sharpness, the texture of the skirt, door and arch, and the sense of motion. One of my favourites in this challenge.', '2007-07-24 12:18:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3931838, 555045, 64035, '<td valign="top">Fabulous light and sharpness. I''m not totally convinced by the ivy-covered tree. Great image, though.</td>', 'Fabulous light and sharpness. I''m not totally convinced by the ivy-covered tree. Great image, though.', '2007-07-24 12:26:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3931845, 556229, 64035, '<td valign="top">Nice photo. I like the tone immensely, and the composition is pretty good. The long shadow from the top right down and left - looks like a lampost or somesuch - is a flaw, I think.</td>', 'Nice photo. I like the tone immensely, and the composition is pretty good. The long shadow from the top right down and left - looks like a lampost or somesuch - is a flaw, I think.', '2007-07-24 12:28:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3931847, 556166, 64035, '<td valign="top">Good characterful shot. Would be better with the background a little softer and her hands a little darker, I think.</td>', 'Good characterful shot. Would be better with the background a little softer and her hands a little darker, I think.', '2007-07-24 12:29:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3931849, 553563, 64035, '<td valign="top">Great texture, tone and character. Really good light. Not sure about the title.</td>', 'Great texture, tone and character. Really good light. Not sure about the title.', '2007-07-24 12:29:57.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3931852, 557073, 64035, '<td valign="top">Lovely atmosphere about this, and great use of the light. The negative space to the right might be just a touch too dark (or conversely too light) - I ended up struggling to make out what it was, rather than being able to see or just ignoring it.</td>', 'Lovely atmosphere about this, and great use of the light. The negative space to the right might be just a touch too dark (or conversely too light) - I ended up struggling to make out what it was, rather than being able to see or just ignoring it.', '2007-07-24 12:30:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3931854, 557048, 64035, '<td valign="top">Great image. I love the tones of his face, and the crispness of the water droplets. Not so fond of the darker areas - a more even background would have been more pleasing to me.</td>', 'Great image. I love the tones of his face, and the crispness of the water droplets. Not so fond of the darker areas - a more even background would have been more pleasing to me.', '2007-07-24 12:31:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3931856, 556818, 64035, '<td valign="top">Nice use of colour and a good tight characterful shot, with a great pose and good props. It''s perhaps just a touch soft - a little sharper and it would be perfect.</td>', 'Nice use of colour and a good tight characterful shot, with a great pose and good props. It''s perhaps just a touch soft - a little sharper and it would be perfect.', '2007-07-24 12:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3931858, 556662, 64035, '<td valign="top">Tonnes of emotion here, great texture and sharpness. Maybe isn''t the perfect shot for this challenge, being as the face is hidden, but it''s a pretty fine shot generally.</td>', 'Tonnes of emotion here, great texture and sharpness. Maybe isn''t the perfect shot for this challenge, being as the face is hidden, but it''s a pretty fine shot generally.', '2007-07-24 12:32:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3931861, 555698, 64035, '<td valign="top">Not certain about the distorted features, but it''s a very interesting photograph, with bunches of character.</td>', 'Not certain about the distorted features, but it''s a very interesting photograph, with bunches of character.', '2007-07-24 12:33:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3931864, 555852, 64035, '<td valign="top">Lovely sharpness and lighting. Great background, but the rest of the composition is a little standard.</td>', 'Lovely sharpness and lighting. Great background, but the rest of the composition is a little standard.', '2007-07-24 12:33:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3931869, 555569, 64035, '<td valign="top">Wonderful sharpness on her face, and lovely softness around it. A really accomplished shot. Not 100% sure about the border on this one.</td>', 'Wonderful sharpness on her face, and lovely softness around it. A really accomplished shot. Not 100% sure about the border on this one.', '2007-07-24 12:34:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3931870, 556464, 81642, '<td valign="top">i like this.</td>', 'i like this.', '2007-07-24 12:35:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3931871, 555323, 64035, '<td valign="top">Great sharpness on her face. The background is a bit of a mess - I hate the pink to the right hand side. Nice composition, though.</td>', 'Great sharpness on her face. The background is a bit of a mess - I hate the pink to the right hand side. Nice composition, though.', '2007-07-24 12:35:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3931874, 557060, 64035, '<td valign="top">A bit snapshotty, but a superior snapshot. I could do without the stuff at the bottom right hand corner.</td>', 'A bit snapshotty, but a superior snapshot. I could do without the stuff at the bottom right hand corner.', '2007-07-24 12:36:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3931876, 556843, 64035, '<td valign="top">Lovely light, and great sharpness for what must have been quite difficult conditions.</td>', 'Lovely light, and great sharpness for what must have been quite difficult conditions.', '2007-07-24 12:36:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3931878, 556962, 73998, '<td valign="top">Cute picture but the color balance seems a little off.</td>', 'Cute picture but the color balance seems a little off.', '2007-07-24 12:37:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3931881, 554305, 73998, '<td valign="top">The eyes look great but I would''ve cloned out the scratches and marks on his face.</td>', 'The eyes look great but I would''ve cloned out the scratches and marks on his face.', '2007-07-24 12:38:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3931882, 554811, 64035, '<td valign="top">Sharpness, character, good composition. The light is a little flat, and the background could just be a touch softer to be perfect.</td>', 'Sharpness, character, good composition. The light is a little flat, and the background could just be a touch softer to be perfect.', '2007-07-24 12:38:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3931883, 556829, 64035, '<td valign="top">Nice light, good tight image. Perhaps lacking a little "wow" factor.</td>', 'Nice light, good tight image. Perhaps lacking a little "wow" factor.', '2007-07-24 12:39:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3931886, 557054, 64035, '<td valign="top">Love the high-contrast, and the sharpness of his eye. Composition is excellent too. Border is horrid - it looks really uneven.</td>', 'Love the high-contrast, and the sharpness of his eye. Composition is excellent too. Border is horrid - it looks really uneven.', '2007-07-24 12:40:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3931888, 556456, 73998, '<td valign="top">I always thought of natural light as light from the sun but I guess this works...</td>', 'I always thought of natural light as light from the sun but I guess this works...', '2007-07-24 12:40:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3931890, 555183, 64035, '<td valign="top">I imagine this was taken under difficult circumstances. Lovely sharpness and character, despite that.</td>', 'I imagine this was taken under difficult circumstances. Lovely sharpness and character, despite that.', '2007-07-24 12:40:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3931893, 556621, 10535, '<td valign="top">Neither on focus</td>', 'Neither on focus', '2007-07-24 12:41:21.000000', NULL, 1),
