(3931896, 556304, 64035, '<td valign="top">This is lovely. The light is gorgeous. I think it suffers from being brought down to DPC size - would be great bigger.</td>', 'This is lovely. The light is gorgeous. I think it suffers from being brought down to DPC size - would be great bigger.', '2007-07-24 12:41:45.000000', NULL, 1),
