(3932184, 556836, 64035, '<td valign="top">And a very nice animal it is too. Like the smooth background, and the nice tight focus. Would like to have seen more of its eye, though. Can''t you persuade it to pose a bit more?</td>', 'And a very nice animal it is too. Like the smooth background, and the nice tight focus. Would like to have seen more of its eye, though. Can''t you persuade it to pose a bit more?', '2007-07-24 14:34:55.000000', NULL, 1),
