(3933840, 556836, 7485, '<td valign="top">Feeling a bit defensive? ;-)  Don''t worry, your photo stands on its own. The lighting is excellent, really focuses the attention on the face and horn, while still leaving enough on the background to add depth. If it gets voted down by others, I''d expect it would be for lack of "wow"-factor, rather than for subject matter. 8</td>', 'Feeling a bit defensive? ;-)  Don''t worry, your photo stands on its own. The lighting is excellent, really focuses the attention on the face and horn, while still leaving enough on the background to add depth. If it gets voted down by others, I''d expect it would be for lack of "wow"-factor, rather than for subject matter. 8', '2007-07-25 00:48:36.000000', NULL, 1),
