(3935190, 556906, 66348, '<td valign="top">Damn this was IMO a top 10. Guess there are a lot of anal people like you said. :P Still a great shot, you should be very happy with this shot. I think the "Elf" type shot was the first shot I really thought, "Man this guy is good". So I think that taking a few more with the mystical look would be bad ass. Great shot man and keep up the great work!<br/> <br/>Edit: P.S. I don''t think you should tell her that she has the elf look down. :P<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-07-25 09:03:18.</i></td>', 'Damn this was IMO a top 10. Guess there are a lot of anal people like you said. :P Still a great shot, you should be very happy with this shot. I think the "Elf" type shot was the first shot I really thought, "Man this guy is good". So I think that taking a few more with the mystical look would be bad ass. Great shot man and keep up the great work! Edit: P.S. I don''t think you should tell her that she has the elf look down. :P', '2007-07-25 10:02:37.000000', '2007-07-25 10:03:18.000000', 0),
