(3935368, 554043, 22872, '<td valign="top">it''s spooky how much this guy looks like my brother Michael!  Our family has the ''bushy'' eyebrows as well :)<br/>(we''re basque)<br/><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-07-25 10:20:43.</i></td>', 'it''s spooky how much this guy looks like my brother Michael!  Our family has the ''bushy'' eyebrows as well :)(we''re basque)', '2007-07-25 10:52:28.000000', '2007-07-25 11:20:43.000000', 0),
(3935379, 556782, 80912, '<td valign="top">Thanks everyone for your comments.<br/> <br/>The original had too many competing/clashing colors, so the greenish-sepia was my choice (and I still like it, in spite of the comments, lol). But I agree that a bit more contrast would improve it.<br/> <br/>I was a bit frustrated by the cropping and ended up w/ the oval, even though I wasn''t happy w/ it. I would have preferred transparent to white, but my software wasn''t cooperating and I never did figure it out.<br/> <br/>I also considered having the horse jumping out of the frame (I''ve actually done similar images), but wasn''t sure it was legal (is it?), so it was funny that DistantColours suggested it.<br/> <br/>I met my goal (higher than 300), and I think 4.8 is a good place to start.</td>', 'Thanks everyone for your comments. The original had too many competing/clashing colors, so the greenish-sepia was my choice (and I still like it, in spite of the comments, lol). But I agree that a bit more contrast would improve it. I was a bit frustrated by the cropping and ended up w/ the oval, even though I wasn''t happy w/ it. I would have preferred transparent to white, but my software wasn''t cooperating and I never did figure it out. I also considered having the horse jumping out of the frame (I''ve actually done similar images), but wasn''t sure it was legal (is it?), so it was funny that DistantColours suggested it. I met my goal (higher than 300), and I think 4.8 is a good place to start.', '2007-07-25 10:57:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(3935402, 554353, 43548, '<td valign="top">i know i didn''t do great, but i''m very happy for my first challenge entry. i''d like to thank everyone who left feedback. i will try to use the info to improve. thank you.</td>', 'i know i didn''t do great, but i''m very happy for my first challenge entry. i''d like to thank everyone who left feedback. i will try to use the info to improve. thank you.', '2007-07-25 11:02:16.000000', NULL, 0),
