(3935900, 555599, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oh no. . .I think the high key, over-exposure looks very artistic and beautiful.   I mean, what brings more light into a life than a brand new baby.   That''s what the light conveys to me.   It takes it to a new level from being a snapshot. . .to art!<br/> <br/>Way underrated if you ask me -- but I''m seeing that alot in this challenge, so what else is new!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Oh no. . .I think the high key, over-exposure looks very artistic and beautiful.   I mean, what brings more light into a life than a brand new baby.   That''s what the light conveys to me.   It takes it to a new level from being a snapshot. . .to art! Way underrated if you ask me -- but I''m seeing that alot in this challenge, so what else is new! ', '2007-07-25 13:15:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(3935907, 556283, 19708, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to see this finish much higher - it should have.<br/>The angle and general feel-good atmosphere here is just great.<br/>Smiles do so much for a shot, and this is no exception. Well done!</td>', 'I would have liked to see this finish much higher - it should have.The angle and general feel-good atmosphere here is just great.Smiles do so much for a shot, and this is no exception. Well done!', '2007-07-25 13:17:00.000000', NULL, 0),
