(3936002, 555021, 19708, '<td valign="top"><b>(( Big Sandy Hug ))</b> Meant to do that before Sandy when I heard - I got too busy it seems :(<br/> <br/>Can Summer come over here next? I don''t have a pool though.<br/>Funny, when I just scrolled down on this, cutting off the top part of the pic where here hair parts in different directions, made a big difference i the crop and how it looks overall, and rather like it tighter cropped. pay me no mind though - I''m odd when it comes to cropping.<br/> <br/>I do like the expression you captured here. The colors and pose are just great! <br/> <br/></td>', '(( Big Sandy Hug )) Meant to do that before Sandy when I heard - I got too busy it seems :( Can Summer come over here next? I don''t have a pool though.Funny, when I just scrolled down on this, cutting off the top part of the pic where here hair parts in different directions, made a big difference i the crop and how it looks overall, and rather like it tighter cropped. pay me no mind though - I''m odd when it comes to cropping. I do like the expression you captured here. The colors and pose are just great!  ', '2007-07-25 13:39:18.000000', NULL, 0),
