(3936236, 553756, 81164, '<td valign="top">Please accept my apologizes as I failed to acknowledge all three words in the challenge. I read the "Natural Light" part but I failed to acknowledge the "Portrait" part. However, after reading your comments, I looked up the word and discovered the word ''portrait'' is defined as: "a likeness of a person, esp. of the face, as a painting, drawing, or photograph: a gallery of family portraits." (Source: //dictionary.reference.com/browse/portrait) Once I discovered my error I contacted the folks at DPChallenge and asked them to remove the image from the contest but, to date, they have failed to do so.</td>', 'Please accept my apologizes as I failed to acknowledge all three words in the challenge. I read the "Natural Light" part but I failed to acknowledge the "Portrait" part. However, after reading your comments, I looked up the word and discovered the word ''portrait'' is defined as: "a likeness of a person, esp. of the face, as a painting, drawing, or photograph: a gallery of family portraits." (Source: //dictionary.reference.com/browse/portrait) Once I discovered my error I contacted the folks at DPChallenge and asked them to remove the image from the contest but, to date, they have failed to do so.', '2007-07-25 14:47:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(3936266, 556389, 255, '<td valign="top">pfft. you always do everything right. ;)</td>', 'pfft. you always do everything right. ;)', '2007-07-25 14:54:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(3936268, 557054, 255, '<td valign="top">hi jack. cutie. :)</td>', 'hi jack. cutie. :)', '2007-07-25 14:55:23.000000', NULL, 0),
