(3936786, 553980, 15711, '<td valign="top">Another adorable shot, susi.  I think what hurt it was that fact that the natural light wasn''t as obvious as the DPC crowd wants. If Cassa Marie had been by a window with the light streaming in - it would have done better, if that makes sense.  Her whimsical expression and playful interaction with the umbrella is most charming.  Don''t let these voters get you down.</td>', 'Another adorable shot, susi.  I think what hurt it was that fact that the natural light wasn''t as obvious as the DPC crowd wants. If Cassa Marie had been by a window with the light streaming in - it would have done better, if that makes sense.  Her whimsical expression and playful interaction with the umbrella is most charming.  Don''t let these voters get you down.', '2007-07-25 17:18:47.000000', NULL, 0),
