(3937719, 556389, 19708, '<td valign="top">Julia!<br/>OMG - just when I thought I''d seen your best slide show, along comes Trash the Dress!<br/> <br/>How do you do that? Aside from the technicals, I want to know how you capture the moment - how much do you orchestrate? What resides in you to find the music to accompany it? Where does the creativity and ideas come from? How long have you been doing this? I want to crawl inside your head for a while - not necessarily for weddings, but for how you capture the spirit of the human soul.<br/> <br/>I''m amazed.</td>', 'Julia!OMG - just when I thought I''d seen your best slide show, along comes Trash the Dress! How do you do that? Aside from the technicals, I want to know how you capture the moment - how much do you orchestrate? What resides in you to find the music to accompany it? Where does the creativity and ideas come from? How long have you been doing this? I want to crawl inside your head for a while - not necessarily for weddings, but for how you capture the spirit of the human soul. I''m amazed.', '2007-07-25 22:29:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(3937771, 556389, 40106, '<td valign="top">alive.<br/> <br/>thats how your work makes me feel!  and you know what.  sometimes when i look at certain photographers work it makes me feel doomed... like, shit, i could never ever be that good.  but when i look at your work i feel the opposite.  so inspired and hopeful.  because, to me, it seems as though you''re just wholeheartedly in love with the human spirit.  like, you''re not really trying to impress anybody... you''re just making everything beautiful because thats what you were made to do.  thats what i admire so very very much.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-07-25 21:41:18.</i></td>', 'alive. thats how your work makes me feel!  and you know what.  sometimes when i look at certain photographers work it makes me feel doomed... like, shit, i could never ever be that good.  but when i look at your work i feel the opposite.  so inspired and hopeful.  because, to me, it seems as though you''re just wholeheartedly in love with the human spirit.  like, you''re not really trying to impress anybody... you''re just making everything beautiful because thats what you were made to do.  thats what i admire so very very much.', '2007-07-25 22:40:05.000000', '2007-07-25 22:41:18.000000', 0),
