(3937984, 553980, 24111, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Jutilda:</b></div><hr/><i> Another adorable shot, susi.  I think what hurt it was that fact that the natural light wasn''t as obvious as the DPC crowd wants. If Cassa Marie had been by a window with the light streaming in - it would have done better, if that makes sense.  Her whimsical expression and playful interaction with the umbrella is most charming.  Don''t let these voters get you down. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I agree! I think you make a good point! No, the voting doesn''t bother me! Thanks so much!</td>', 'Originally posted by Jutilda: Another adorable shot, susi.  I think what hurt it was that fact that the natural light wasn''t as obvious as the DPC crowd wants. If Cassa Marie had been by a window with the light streaming in - it would have done better, if that makes sense.  Her whimsical expression and playful interaction with the umbrella is most charming.  Don''t let these voters get you down.   I agree! I think you make a good point! No, the voting doesn''t bother me! Thanks so much!', '2007-07-25 23:32:13.000000', NULL, 0),
