(3938063, 556857, 62318, '<td valign="top">Cool shot! I think there is a slight blue tinge to the light, though it is only a nit-pick. Love the stark blue eyes.</td>', 'Cool shot! I think there is a slight blue tinge to the light, though it is only a nit-pick. Love the stark blue eyes.', '2007-07-25 23:59:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(3938094, 556238, 67697, '<td valign="top">I''m surprised that this finished below 5.  And it definitely does not deserve the 1''s, 2''s and 3''s.  I love the expression and that she is looking to the side.  As if keeping an eye on something.  Beautiful earthy color tones in the pic.  Sweet face!<br/> <br/>Oh and as far as shooting for above 6.0, 68 people agreed.  You get an 11+ from me hehe.</td>', 'I''m surprised that this finished below 5.  And it definitely does not deserve the 1''s, 2''s and 3''s.  I love the expression and that she is looking to the side.  As if keeping an eye on something.  Beautiful earthy color tones in the pic.  Sweet face! Oh and as far as shooting for above 6.0, 68 people agreed.  You get an 11+ from me hehe.', '2007-07-26 00:09:31.000000', NULL, 0),
