(3938947, 555021, 66597, '<td valign="top">Don''t you just hate those 5.9++ scores, LOL? I think this is a gorgeous portrait. Summer looks like a professional model - she is one stunning young woman! And of course with your skills you bring out the best. I love how it looks like you have catchlights in her hair even though it is a natural light portrait. Beautiful as always.</td>', 'Don''t you just hate those 5.9++ scores, LOL? I think this is a gorgeous portrait. Summer looks like a professional model - she is one stunning young woman! And of course with your skills you bring out the best. I love how it looks like you have catchlights in her hair even though it is a natural light portrait. Beautiful as always.', '2007-07-26 09:39:05.000000', NULL, 0),
