(3939423, 556389, 51538, '<td valign="top">Now that is work.  I was not sure what I was looking at when voting.  For some stupid reason water never came to mind.  Flying did.  Flying means air...  such is life. ETA your slideshow is inspiring, enjoyable, beautiful.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-07-26 12:35:52.</i></td>', 'Now that is work.  I was not sure what I was looking at when voting.  For some stupid reason water never came to mind.  Flying did.  Flying means air...  such is life. ETA your slideshow is inspiring, enjoyable, beautiful.', '2007-07-26 12:35:33.000000', '2007-07-26 13:35:52.000000', 0),
(3939527, 556947, 63269, '<td valign="top">Extremely powerful. The composition, the shadows, and the way the light plays on her face draws my attention immediately to that eye. The blue tones are glorious, and the color harmony you have here - with a touch of blue glinting in the background, the blue shirt, and the blue eye - is fabulous. It is maybe a little dark, but I like the low-key effect so much. Wonderful image.</td>', 'Extremely powerful. The composition, the shadows, and the way the light plays on her face draws my attention immediately to that eye. The blue tones are glorious, and the color harmony you have here - with a touch of blue glinting in the background, the blue shirt, and the blue eye - is fabulous. It is maybe a little dark, but I like the low-key effect so much. Wonderful image.', '2007-07-26 13:09:15.000000', NULL, 0),
