(3939603, 556980, 63269, '<td valign="top">Sickeningly under-rated. This is amazing. Your use of lighting here is so intriguing. The way you let the face slide into shadow is unique and adds such intensity to the image. I would have instinctively tried to lighten the face and darken everything else. Brilliant work.</td>', 'Sickeningly under-rated. This is amazing. Your use of lighting here is so intriguing. The way you let the face slide into shadow is unique and adds such intensity to the image. I would have instinctively tried to lighten the face and darken everything else. Brilliant work.', '2007-07-26 13:32:38.000000', NULL, 0),
