(3943186, 556773, 66597, '<td valign="top">Svetlana - not sure what you are trying to convey here, but it is a lovely portrait, no doubt. My first thought was maybe you are pregnant and the ballet skirt won''t quite close? Don''t want to start rumors, though :-) I''d be interested to know what the emotive behind this one is.</td>', 'Svetlana - not sure what you are trying to convey here, but it is a lovely portrait, no doubt. My first thought was maybe you are pregnant and the ballet skirt won''t quite close? Don''t want to start rumors, though :-) I''d be interested to know what the emotive behind this one is.', '2007-07-27 16:51:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(3943353, 555955, 64703, '<td valign="top">The eye really makes this image for me.  Congrats, it definitely deserved the ribbon.</td>', 'The eye really makes this image for me.  Congrats, it definitely deserved the ribbon.', '2007-07-27 18:33:36.000000', NULL, 0),
