(3943876, 555029, 60657, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by annpatt:</b></div><hr/><i> Hey Aref, keep trying. This is a nice shot, and in a more appropriate challenge, would have scored much better. <br/> <br/>In addition to entering a shot that meets the challenge better, you might look at <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/tutorial.php?TUTORIAL_ID=26" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">this tutorial</a> to prepare your entry for the challenge. Most voters will vote lower on entries that are less than 640 pixels on the longest side. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Hi Ann. Thanks for the tip, kind words and the very useful tutorial! The color-space section is informative.</td>', 'Originally posted by annpatt: Hey Aref, keep trying. This is a nice shot, and in a more appropriate challenge, would have scored much better.  In addition to entering a shot that meets the challenge better, you might look at this tutorial to prepare your entry for the challenge. Most voters will vote lower on entries that are less than 640 pixels on the longest side.  Hi Ann. Thanks for the tip, kind words and the very useful tutorial! The color-space section is informative.', '2007-07-27 22:31:08.000000', NULL, 0),
