(3956332, 556389, 8860, '<td valign="top">Oh. The bar has just been raised.</td>', 'Oh. The bar has just been raised.', '2007-08-01 07:10:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(3956649, 554521, 69700, '<td valign="top">I am amazed at the comments about this photo being sexiest.  I showed this to my wife, and she agreed with me.  The emphases of the photo is not body or the face, but the lines and curves.  The womans body and face were there to provide the curves to the lines.  If I was shooting this photo, my first instinct (and would not have been anywhere near as interesting as this photo) would be to have a deep DOF so it would be all in focus.  <br/> <br/>One of the reasons I view the photos in DPC is to learn from others.  This was a great lesson in creativity.</td>', 'I am amazed at the comments about this photo being sexiest.  I showed this to my wife, and she agreed with me.  The emphases of the photo is not body or the face, but the lines and curves.  The womans body and face were there to provide the curves to the lines.  If I was shooting this photo, my first instinct (and would not have been anywhere near as interesting as this photo) would be to have a deep DOF so it would be all in focus.   One of the reasons I view the photos in DPC is to learn from others.  This was a great lesson in creativity.', '2007-08-01 09:49:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(3957017, 555021, 29011, '<td valign="top">So sorry to learn of your Dad''s passing *hugs*<br/>This is bright and cheery shot and I''m glad you''ve found something to lift your spirits and bring back a sense of normalcy.</td>', 'So sorry to learn of your Dad''s passing *hugs*This is bright and cheery shot and I''m glad you''ve found something to lift your spirits and bring back a sense of normalcy.', '2007-08-01 11:35:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(3958655, 556389, 68504, '<td valign="top">Not that you need another comment in the 10 ballpark... Reminiscent of Julia Cameron: the hair(which is fabulous along with dress - they both transmute to magic in the water) and the light give it the pre-Raphael feel; yet the composition is original and fabulous. Subtlety and restraint in title.</td>', 'Not that you need another comment in the 10 ballpark... Reminiscent of Julia Cameron: the hair(which is fabulous along with dress - they both transmute to magic in the water) and the light give it the pre-Raphael feel; yet the composition is original and fabulous. Subtlety and restraint in title.', '2007-08-01 18:41:17.000000', NULL, 0),
