(3959472, 554521, 57060, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by lantaga:</b></div><hr/><i> I am amazed at the comments about this photo being sexiest.  I showed this to my wife, and she agreed with me.  The emphases of the photo is not body or the face, but the lines and curves.  The womans body and face were there to provide the curves to the lines.  If I was shooting this photo, my first instinct (and would not have been anywhere near as interesting as this photo) would be to have a deep DOF so it would be all in focus.  <br/> <br/>One of the reasons I view the photos in DPC is to learn from others.  This was a great lesson in creativity. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I agree totally<br/> <br/>Jack</td>', 'Originally posted by lantaga: I am amazed at the comments about this photo being sexiest.  I showed this to my wife, and she agreed with me.  The emphases of the photo is not body or the face, but the lines and curves.  The womans body and face were there to provide the curves to the lines.  If I was shooting this photo, my first instinct (and would not have been anywhere near as interesting as this photo) would be to have a deep DOF so it would be all in focus.   One of the reasons I view the photos in DPC is to learn from others.  This was a great lesson in creativity.   I agree totally Jack', '2007-08-01 22:51:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(3960082, 555418, 63267, '<td valign="top">Wow, look at all of those 1''s.  Who says people are too serious around here?  great attempt at humor. I think you fit the challenge well and should have scored much higher than you did.  Lighting is great.  Only think I would have liked to have seen is you could have given him a little glass and maybe a little pump on top of the can to make it look like a keg!  but hey you still took a great photo, wnet out on a limb, unfortunately you just weren''t rewarded with the score.</td>', 'Wow, look at all of those 1''s.  Who says people are too serious around here?  great attempt at humor. I think you fit the challenge well and should have scored much higher than you did.  Lighting is great.  Only think I would have liked to have seen is you could have given him a little glass and maybe a little pump on top of the can to make it look like a keg!  but hey you still took a great photo, wnet out on a limb, unfortunately you just weren''t rewarded with the score.', '2007-08-02 01:28:44.000000', NULL, 0),
