(4715911, 553192, 68504, '<td valign="top">Yes, the lighting, the scene, the dignity and the improbability raise this above the merely good, above the ordinary. (How ''bout some more?)</td>', 'Yes, the lighting, the scene, the dignity and the improbability raise this above the merely good, above the ordinary. (How ''bout some more?)', '2008-05-21 18:53:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(4722978, 553192, 65234, '<td valign="top">The lighting is superb and I love the pastels and the detail on the fur.  Now I''m going to be tempted to tell all my clients to meet me at sunset by the water :-)  I know human portrait photographers try this, but I hadn''t thought it would work so well for animals.  Just lovely.  (And BTW, in my experience Bulldogs have AWESOME personalities so it''s nice to see one portrayed so well).</td>', 'The lighting is superb and I love the pastels and the detail on the fur.  Now I''m going to be tempted to tell all my clients to meet me at sunset by the water :-)  I know human portrait photographers try this, but I hadn''t thought it would work so well for animals.  Just lovely.  (And BTW, in my experience Bulldogs have AWESOME personalities so it''s nice to see one portrayed so well).', '2008-05-25 18:54:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(4779556, 553563, 48228, '<td valign="top">What an amazing man, so full of character, and gee, he is your husband, and with such a great face to capture. <br/>I love the rugged textures that you have captured here, awesome detail and color tones, and also that stern look, as it really make this image pop. A truly great portrait of your dear husband. <br/>You should be very proud. Thank you.</td>', 'What an amazing man, so full of character, and gee, he is your husband, and with such a great face to capture. I love the rugged textures that you have captured here, awesome detail and color tones, and also that stern look, as it really make this image pop. A truly great portrait of your dear husband. You should be very proud. Thank you.', '2008-06-21 21:48:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(4782798, 556399, 27133, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous curls!</td>', 'Gorgeous curls!', '2008-06-24 06:02:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(4810377, 554305, 78212, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by citymars:</b></div><hr/><i> I was one of your two 9s on this.  I''m surprised to learn you touched up the lips -- I thought for sure those who commented on it were wrong.  That''s how youthful lips look!  Anyway, I like the serious look on the boy''s face and the fact you let the blemishes show.  Handsome kid, too. </i></td></tr></table>hey i know that kid<br/></td>', 'Originally posted by citymars: I was one of your two 9s on this.  I''m surprised to learn you touched up the lips -- I thought for sure those who commented on it were wrong.  That''s how youthful lips look!  Anyway, I like the serious look on the boy''s face and the fact you let the blemishes show.  Handsome kid, too. hey i know that kid', '2008-07-07 22:44:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(4933943, 556109, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like the title. This is why I don''t do a lot of portraits of my family. You have to have cooperative models with patience. I can appreciate why modeling is a career and actually takes some skill.</td>', 'I like the title. This is why I don''t do a lot of portraits of my family. You have to have cooperative models with patience. I can appreciate why modeling is a career and actually takes some skill.', '2008-09-04 11:45:31.000000', NULL, 0),
