(5378017, 555132, 24454, '<td valign="top">He has the kind of face that I would also try to photograph if I saw him on the street :)  I''m glad you were able to get the photo :)   He''d probably love it if he saw it.  He looks so distinquished and has haunting eyes.<br/> <br/></td>', 'He has the kind of face that I would also try to photograph if I saw him on the street :)  I''m glad you were able to get the photo :)   He''d probably love it if he saw it.  He looks so distinquished and has haunting eyes. ', '2009-03-16 21:59:05.000000', NULL, 0),
