(5391179, 554183, 105007, '<td valign="top">I saw in ArtNews that Anders Stone is a real tough interview to get.  Is this really a photo of him?  I have only seen pictures of him when he was much younger.  Fantastic shot! Can you give us a little background of where and how you got him to pose for you?  <br/> <br/></td>', 'I saw in ArtNews that Anders Stone is a real tough interview to get.  Is this really a photo of him?  I have only seen pictures of him when he was much younger.  Fantastic shot! Can you give us a little background of where and how you got him to pose for you?   ', '2009-03-19 03:03:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(5701470, 556543, 83313, '<td valign="top">My daughter used to do this, except she would get caught behind furniture. I have a photo somewhere of her caught between her bed frame and the window.</td>', 'My daughter used to do this, except she would get caught behind furniture. I have a photo somewhere of her caught between her bed frame and the window.', '2009-10-26 20:25:49.000000', NULL, 0),
