(6285033, 557054, 1897, '<td valign="top">Really like this, something on his right cheek seems like it is over compressed in the lighting, but great use of chiaroscuro.</td>', 'Really like this, something on his right cheek seems like it is over compressed in the lighting, but great use of chiaroscuro.', '2011-01-16 21:40:46.000000', NULL, 0),
