(6285045, 556947, 1897, '<td valign="top">This almost look like a movie still.  I like the contrast on the subject but I think she needs to be lightened a bit to make her pop from the background.</td>', 'This almost look like a movie still.  I like the contrast on the subject but I think she needs to be lightened a bit to make her pop from the background.', '2011-01-16 21:49:09.000000', NULL, 0),
