(6342569, 555505, 25190, '<td valign="top">I think you could have had him pose abit more i feel the shot you took here just isnt working with the glasses his positioning it lacks sharpness too to soft for my liking his frowning too i feel you should have some positive feeling too the shot ..Gord..keep trying your heading in the right direction <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-03-06 03:19:54.</i></td>', 'I think you could have had him pose abit more i feel the shot you took here just isnt working with the glasses his positioning it lacks sharpness too to soft for my liking his frowning too i feel you should have some positive feeling too the shot ..Gord..keep trying your heading in the right direction ', '2011-03-06 03:18:46.000000', '2011-03-06 03:19:54.000000', 0);
